<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Tigraayit</book>
  <para style="h">Wadaddiit Luúkaam</para>
  <para style="toc3">WLU</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wadaddiit Luúkaam</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wadaddiit Luúkaam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wadaddiit Luúkaam</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Waqad ib Rox Ghiddus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Taawfilus yaha, diibba kitaabye la salfaay ib killu la Yasoq wadayu wa qallama ibbu dagamko ikka min istibda kidmatu <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />asikka amqil la asik sama traffaqa itta xagho wasiyaat ib gabey Rox Ghiddus igilla luúkaam la ilom xara abtsaxa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Wa igil maddat qarbaqa amqil xagho matstsatu wa motu awghaat bizxit abhaza ittom wa ib adillat waajdat shak baatkat xiyaay kim halla asbata ilom wa ib mamlakat Rabbi tahaagayom.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Wa gorom ijtimoq inintu belayom, “Orshaliim iititrako! Diiba tsinxo asikka tamiimma waqadda Ab la badiir xaakekokum ibbu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yuxanna addaam ib maay qammada. Intim laata xagho amqelaat ib Rox Ghiddus igil titqammado tu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qarrajot Yasoq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Wa la ijtimqaam qalaw saálawu, “Wo Molaay, illi la waghit la mamlakat Israíil tballis ittu tu?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ka balsa ittom, “Aamarotta mawaaqiid wa la awghaat la Ab ib sildtatu xaddadaya min shuúnkum iiko. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Minnaata dolat la Rox Ghiddus litkarre itkum ghiwat trakbo wa shawaahiijje tgabbó diib Orshaliim, wa diib Yahudiya wa Saamira killan, wa asik ghirid midir.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Illa bela wa asik sama traffaq inde lirúwu wa xare dabna min qintaatom xabqattu.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Wa hitom sama inde laáfgho wa hitu aska inde lidtdtallagh, kilót inaas libbaas tsaqada laabsaam xawatsaw ittom <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />wa belawom, “Sab Al Jaliil yahaw, igil mi inde badtarkum qastar ghilic tiblo hallekum? Illi Yasoq la asikka qastar inde tirúwu qarraja, kimma qarrajaya reékumu igil laqaghbil minna tu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mattiyaas Yahuza kallif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Wa xare la luúkaam asik Orshaliim qaghbalaw minna dabir la ib Dabir Zeytun litámmar wa hitu ghirub Orshaliim tu it nasaafat it amqil sabit igil titgayas litájjaz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilomitir ghaarib</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Wa kim batsxaw asik ghurfat itta dtabaghat la laqaaliit qargaw wa diiba kaaryaam qalaw wa hitom Budtrus wa Yuxanna wa Yaqghub wa Andaraawus wa Filibbos wa Tuma wa Barsalmaawus wa Matta wa Yaqghub Wad Xalfi wa Samqaan la wadtani wa Yahuza wad Yaqghub qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Wa killom ib oro lib daqa laáttalaalu qalaw wa gale anis qalaya mislom wa Maryam im Yasoq wa xawu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Wa amqil xatte, miít wa qisra la batstsoxo jimqaam qalaw minna xaw wa Budtrus qala baakom. Wa bidtaaru gabá wa kiínna inde libil kaadtabayom, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Yahaw xaw, la Kitub la Rox Ghiddus ib af Daawid it Yahuza belayu igil litmam qala ilu. Hitu tu la igil tsebdtat Yasoq merxaay qaghabala. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Wa Yahuza orot min ina litxassab qala wa diib kidmatna shaarakena.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:17">(<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Wa hitu ib maal la qawil kayaanat daffaqayu garhat zaaba wa diiba ib gatstsu wadgha wa dirdtu sadtdtara wa qamqaytu killa jalhadtat. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Wa sab Orshaliim killom ibbilla widiit aamaraw ka la garhatu, Xaghil Damax, samawa ib higyahom, Garhat Dam bahalat ta.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Wa illi la diib Kitaab Mazmur kitub tu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Daaru tikrib</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">wa imbal seknaay tigbá,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 69:25</char></note></para>
  <para style="nb" vid="ACT 1:20">wa bardu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Seru biqid lissallammu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 109:8</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Sababu minna sab la illa maddat ib riima la Yasoq Molaayna kaláya gona tsanxaw misilna, orot igil nixire halla inna <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />min Yuxanna qammadayu asik amqil qarrajotu asik sama igil ib ghaniits Yasoq misilna shaahud igil ligbá.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ka la jimqaam qalaw, kilót inaas rashshaxaw wa hitom Yusif la Yusdtus litbahal (wa Barsaaba litkanne) wa Mattiyaas qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Wa xare daqaw wa belaw, “Wo Molaay, la albaab killu addaam taámmir, kim min illom kilót inaas ayi kim xareka kishaf inna <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />dibba kidmatta liíkat igil litxaawalanna bidaal Yahuza la asikka akaan la taástihillu ebaba.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Wa xare saham karaw wa it Mattiyaas fagra ka itta qasir orot luúkaam wassakawu.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Rox Ghiddus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Amqil Ximsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xagho Qiid Matqaadaay ximsa miqil</char></note> dol xenat, killom baak xid it xatte akaan qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Wa ammat alaba hadiir haatsafot hatsif dighghub massil min sama sammaqa wa killa la bet la diiba gissuyaam qalaw malá. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Wa sanqat sinfata lasassin ghaarxat shaabih raáw wa la lasassin tfanaadtarat wa it ayihomka tkaaret. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wa kil minnomka ib Rox Ghiddus tmallá wa ib hagaggi biqidat igil lithaage astabda kimma Rox Ghiddus qaghadaryu ta.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Wa diib Orshaliim Yahud ferhat Rabbi min umam iddinya killa la matsáw qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ka la kirin dolat samqaw, la jameq xiyur inintu jammaqa jalla orohomka ib higyaahu inde lithaagaw samqayom. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ka marra taqajjabaw wa belaw, “Illom la lithaagaw hallaw, killom min Al Jaliil iiko? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ka kafo ayiinaaka ibba higya la ila dtaabi inde lithaagaw sammaqom halla? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Min Barsiya wa Maadiya wa Qiilaam; wa finge kilé la nahar, wa Yahudiya wa Kabbadukiya, wa Bundtas wa Aasiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mandtighat Romaaniyat</char></note>, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />wa Firiijiya wa Bamfiiliya, wa Masir wa min baakaat Liibya la jafar Ghayrawaan; wa magaanxat min Roma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(Yahud wa mathawidiin); wa Kariitiyiin wa Qarab wa misil illi ib hagaggiina inde lithaagaw ib wadaddiit Rabbi la mistinkirayit insammaqom hallena!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wa killom qajbe wa xirat naasáatom qalaya wa igil xid, “Illi mi maqanat tu?” liblo qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Wa biqidaam haye inlittarjago, “Kamrat taáhaagiyom hallet,” liblo qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kidtbat Budtrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ka Budtrus baakka luúkaam la qasir orot badtra wa ib wighghul kadtba wa bela, “Yahud dtarna wa wo saaknaam Orshaliim kilkum, la ibillu attansu igil zaqachche baal kiraw. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Illom saakraam yahallaw kimma litreékkum, la waghit lissaq fajir saaqat seq halla. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Wa illi la nabi Yuíil la belayu ledta tu:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Itta amqilotaat la dangobiyaat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Roxye it killu la addaam igil qile tu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Wilaadkum wa awaalidkum igil litnabbó tu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">wa shibbaankum ruá igil liráw tu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">wa qabayikum xalamaat igil litxallamo tu.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Wa it agbirye wa aamuchche ma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">Roxye igil qile tu itta amqilotaat lahan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">wa igil litnabbó tu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Itta qastar millaqal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">wa itta arid mittaxat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">qajaayib wa qalamaat igil aré tu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">dam wa isaat wa tanaan xashraay.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Wa la tsaxaay igil titsalmit tu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">wa la warex kim dam igil lighyax tu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ghadam mitsát amqil Molaay la jaliilat wa giwiit.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Wa ib simet Molaay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:21">la liddeqe killu, naggif.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Ka shaqab Israíil yahaw, lib kiraw: Rabbi qalani Yasoq la Naasiri ayada kimma iighawekuma ib gabeyu muqjizaat wa qajaayib wa qalamaat ajra. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Laakiin Rabbi mi kim igil laájre tu aamara wa sittaatu la min badiir wadtdtiit la dolat la Yasoq dtallamaya sadrat. Intim it saliib saamarkumu wa ghatalkumu ib sadayitta shariiqat alabom. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Minnaata Rabbi min mot attaghnatsayu wa matstsata afshala jalaab mot igil ticghammu mustaxiil gabá. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Daawid kiínna bela ittu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Molaay kil xiin misilye kim tu iré halleko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Hitu it dimmaanye tu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">sababu xatte iitahanzizanni.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ka ibbu tu libye farrex</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">wa nissaalye ib xamdehu lablib</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">wa ganobachche it saáyob tghassin.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ajil inta, rixye igil mot iithajjir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">wa ghidduska diib ghabir</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">igil lible iitaázim minnu.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Inta gabey xayot arékanni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">wa ib mitqat xidurka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">igil timlaánni tu.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Xawye yahaw, ib qillun illa igil ibalakkum: abuna Daawid mota wa tghabara wa ghabru asik yom illi tu gona. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Daawid nabi qala wa Rabbi kim maxala ilu aamir qala wad birku it qarshu kim laátgasse. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ka ib qaghnatsót Al Masex min mot tahaaga kimma badiir raáyu. Wa Rabbi rixu igil mot kim iilahajjir wa ganobatu igil biliina kim iititwaggar tahaaga. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yasoq Rabbi min mot attaghnatsayu wa xina kilna ibbilla inshihid. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Illa hitu asik akaan sharaf diib sama traffaqa dimmaan Rabbi, wa la Ab kimma waqadaya la Rox Ghiddus habayu itna igil liqilayu kimma yom tiríwa wa sammiqiwa hallekum. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Jaliib Daawid nosu asik sama yaqarraja wa hitu tu la bela:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Molaay igil Molaayye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Dimmaanye tgasse<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />asik abbachka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">makyadka iwaddiyom,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 110:1 </char></note> belayu.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Sababu ayi Israíili ib yighghun illi laáamir: illi Yasoq la ilu salabkum, Rabbi Molaay wa Masex wadayu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Zaqat Budtrus albaabom admaqat ka iglu wa igilla luúkaam la biqidaam belawom, “Xawna, mi nibassir?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Budtrus balsa ittom, “Kil minkumka min zanbu igil litobe wa gabey Rabbi igil litsbadt wa ib simet Yasoq Al Masex igil litqammad halla ilu igil maghfarat zinubu. Asaru wahabat Rox Ghiddus igil titkabbato tu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Illi waqad illi igilkum wa igil wilaadkum wa igil sab rayiim killom la Rabbi Molaayna litlaakayom tu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Wa xare Budtrus waqazu attalaala wa ib sidud min kil gof shebanayom, “Minna la illi gim la niwnuy littaake halla it maqaddey gibó,” inlibil. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Zaqat Budtrus la amnaw taqammadaw wa itta amqil laha salas alif lagabbaó itta jamaaqat twassakaw.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manaabaratta emnat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />La emnat nafsom ajilla taqaliimma luúkaam wa amxabarot wa matxawaal wajbaat wa daqa karrasaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ajil la luúkaam muqjizaat wa qajaayib bizxaat ajraw, killom haybat tkarret ittom. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wa la emnat killom it xatte akaan laájtamqo qalaw wa killu la qala ilom litxaawolu qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Wa waan maxgaz, maalom wa amlaakom laázabbu qalaw wa la qawil misilla xiguzaam litkaafolu qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Diibba haykal amqilka misil laájtamqo qalaw. Wa diibba abyaat ballaqo qalaw wa ib lawagh qabi wajbaatom ib tsiggot litxaawalo nabraw. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Wa Rabbi laxamdo wa minna shaqab killu ixsaan rakbo qalaw. Wa Molaay amqilka itta jamaaqat la nagfo wassik qala.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Shafi miskun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Amqil xatte, Budtrus wa Yuxanna asikka haykal laqargo qalaw waanna salaat saaqat salas xagho addihir. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Wa sab inaas min mawalladu xankiish inde raffaqo matsáw wa itta maátey La Girrum litbahal karawu. Wa amqilka ittu karriwu qalaw minna la haykal laáattu sadaghat igil lidtlab. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Wa waan Budtrus wa Yuxanna inlaáttu raá igil lissaddagho ittu ramghayom. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Wa Budtrus it gats ganxayu wa kimsalhuma Yuxanna. Wa xare Budtrus beyalu, “Ginxanna!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ka la inaas baal habayom gale igil lirkab minnom inlisé.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Wa xare Budtrus, “Ana dahab aw fiddat alabye laakiin la biyetu haybaka. Ib simet Yasoq Al Masex la Naasiri, herir!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Ib maanu inde nasáyu sandayu wa agiidaay qaghaabba inaas wa la ghalaccimu tarradat. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Wa kartaf wada wa heraar astabda. Wa xare baakom la haykal ata inde leherir wa sarrir wa Rabbi inde laxammid. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wa killom laleherir wa Rabbi laxammid raáwu. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Wa la remghaay la xankiish la itta maátey La Girrum la dolka liríwu qalaw kim tu waan alelaw, tfaajaw wa barayid gabáw.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Budtrus diibba haykal luwiqiz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Wa diibba ghaaqatta haykal la ib Ghaaqat Sulemaan titáammar, la inaas kab ibulom inintu, bizxaam ib shafaag matsáw wa tkallalawu kabar gaabáam inintom. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Wa Budtrus illi dolat raá belayom, “Shaqab Israíil yahaw, illi mihu faajékkum wa igil mi tfazzuna kim xina ib xiilatna wa taghwatna illi inaas atherarna? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Rabbi Ibraahiim wa Rabbi Isxaagh wa Yaqghub, Rabbi abawna killom tu la igil kedmaayu Yasoq jah amtsaá. Yasoq la intim it ide karekumu wa ghadam Bilaadtos tbarrákum minu Bilaadtus igil lidtallighghu ghirrur ma min laqale. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Dtalughgha ghiddus wa la saalex abekum wa ib kilaafu dtalughgha ghetlaay dtalabkum. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Intim haaybaay xayot amutkum wa Rabbi min mot qaghnatsayu wa xina ibbilla amaan inshihid. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Illi inaas ib amiin ib Yasoq tshaffa wa intim kafo miskun kim qala taámro. Amiin ib simet Yasoq ib qintaatkum ingannixiwu qaafayu.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Dtarna, intim wa merxatkum it Yasoq la wadekumu kim figgariit ghiwet qala ammir. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Minnaata Rabbi killom la nabyaat la alhamayu asfa, la Masex illa jirab igil liré kim qala ilu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Ka gidim min zinubkum tobu wa it Rabbi qaghbilo zinubkum igil titnexe <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />wa min Rabbi Molaayna awghaat faraj matstsaákkum ib laákot Yasoq Al Masex asikkum ib xadiis la badiir xarayu ikkum. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />La Masex diib sama igil litsnax laazim tu asikka waghit la kil sanaq sanne ittu laákkil kimma min badiir badayir ib gabey nabyaatu la ghiddusaam waqada ibba. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Ajil Musa bela, ‘Rabbi Molaaykum min shaqab noskum nabi kimsaleye igil libqas ikkum tu igilla liblakkum tu killu lib kiraw. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Wa la lib la iilahayibbu min shaqabu litnattaf.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Ib amaan ma, killom la nabyaat la min Samuíl wa insar la hallaw ib illi waghit tnabbaáw. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Intim wersatta nabyaat wa la galad la Rabbi misil abawkum qaghdayu intim. Igil Ibraahiim belayu, ‘Ib gabey talakka shiqubba iddinya killa igil titbaarak tu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imbutat 22:18</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Rabbi waan kedmaayu baqasa ib salif itkum laákayu igil libaarkakkum ib baliis ayikumka min shiruru.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Budtrus wa Yuxanna ghadamma majlis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Budtrus wa Yuxanna la shaqab inde lithaagaw la kahana wa masúlla xarassa haykal wa la Saddughiyiin matsáwom. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wa sanni duyughaam qalaw sabab la luúkaam ghaniits Yasoq min mot wa ib iijali ghiyaamat laádarso wa laqallino qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ka Budtrus wa Yuxanna tsabdtaw wa jalla maasi madir qala asik tsibbixiita sajnawom. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Laakiin bizxaam minna zaqat samqaw amnaw ka qilibba emnat xamis alif tghaaraba.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Wa fajrata diib Orshaliim la merxat wa sabba gats wa qilamalla shariiqat ajtamaqaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Mislom Xannaan riíssa kahana wa Ghayaafa wa Yuxanna wa Iskandar wa biqidaam la minna faraq riíssa kahana la gaáw. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Wa Budtrus wa Yuxanna tlaakaw wa it migib qabdtarawom wa saálawom, “La ilu wadekum, ib mi xiilat wa ib simet min wadekumu?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Budtrus ib Rox Ghiddus milú inintu balsa ittom, “Yahaw ruásala shaqab wa la qabayiihu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />yom ibba sababba maqruf la igil nafar miskun wadenaahu titxaghghagho min hallekum, kim kafo tshaffa igil taámro, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />intim wa shaqab Israíil killu illa aamro, ib simet Yasoq la Masex la Naasiri la ilu salabkum minnaata Rabbi min mot laághnatsayu tu la inde shaffa ghadamekum baadtir halla. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Illa hitu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘la imin la intim la nedghat tgarafkuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">la iminna xighaab gabát.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 118:22</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Imbal ibbu, mangafo yahallet jalla mittaxat sama Rabbi simet biqidat addaami naggif ibba yahaba.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ka la majlis min bataakat Budtrus wa Yuxanna taqajjaba wa qillumaam kim iiko wa minna qaamatta shaqab kim tom tbayana illom. Wa kim baak Yasoq qalaw fahamaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Laakin la inaas la tshaffa mislom baadtir sabab raáwu la ila liblo saánaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ka la Majlis Budtrus wa Yuxanna ib fagiir ammara igil lishur. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Wa xid saálaw, “Illi sab mi nibassiru? Mistinkir riít kim ajraw wa killom sab Orshaliim kim raáwa igil nibre yiínghaddir. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Minnaata la hidig asikka shaqab ziyaada igil iititnashshar, naxazzirrom girra illa ib simet Yasoq orot igil iilithaagaw.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ka atlaakawom wa killu killu ib simet Yasoq igil iilithaagaw wa iilaádriso ammarawom. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Laakiin Budtrus wa Yuxanna belawom, “Ib qin Rabbi, ayi tu la raateq, dtaqatkum ma dtaaqat Rabbi? Xikamo! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Xina di min mathaagaay ibba raénaahu wa la samqanaahu igil nahawid yiínghaddir.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ka la majlis ziyaada haddadayom wa it makallasi dtallaghawom jallaab igil laqaaghubom iighadraw. Wa killu la shaqab Rabbi laxabbin qala ajilla muqjizat <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />jalliib la inaas la tshaffa miskun inintu millaqal qarbaqa sanat xaalafa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daqala emnat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Wa Budtrus wa Yuxanna kim tarxaw inintu asikka emnat la biqidaam qaghabalaw wa ib killu la ruásaala kahana wa sabba gats belawom tu assaálawom. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ka ib daqa ib oro lib asik Rabbi twajjahaw wa belaw, “Wo Rabbi la Ghadiir, wo Kaaligh midir wa sama wa baxar wa killu la halla diiban, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />wo la ib Rox Ghiddus ib af kedmaayka abuna Daawid:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘La umam, ajil mi tshawshir hallet?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Wa la shiqub, ajil mi ib ghallo ghallotaat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">abyaát wa afgarat?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Milukka iddinya shaamakaw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">wa la ruásaaha ajtamqaw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">wa did Molaay wa masexu tsaadaw,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 2:1-2</char></note> tibe.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ib biyun illi diib illa madiinat jara ajil Hirudos wa Bilaadtos la Bundti wa la wasaniyiin wa shaqab Israíil did Yasoq kedmaayka la ghiddus la ilu qashshalka taxaalafaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />La hitom wadawu killu min badiir isduru qalaka xassabba sildtatka wa iraadatka. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Wa aze, wo Molaay, tahdiidom simaq wa igilna agbirka bataakat baatkat habanna zaqatka igil naqallin. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Wa ideka ib xiilat shifa midad ib simet Yasoq kedmaayka la ghiddus mistinkiraat wa qajaayib igil tijre.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Wa xagho daqaw la akaan la itta ijtimqaam qalaw hanghalghalat wa killom ib Rox Ghiddus tmalláw wa ib bataakat zaqat Rabbi igil laqallino astabdaw.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">La emnat la bom tu litxaawalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Wa la emnat oro lib wa oro qaghil qalaw. Wa nafar minnom la bu tu killu kim naay bannu tu lissammuqu yaqala, naay xiwaale qala indiíko. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Wa la luúkaam ib xiilat daamghat ib ghaniits Molaay Yasoq lishhido qalaw. Wa niqimat Rabbi ib ruúy misil killom qalat <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />wa diib migbom xiguz yaqala sabab killom la girah aw abyaat qala ilom laázabbiwa wa ib qawla matstsó qalaw <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />wa xantela luúkaam karruwu qalaw. Wa hitom itta xiguzaam wazziqiwu qalaw igil oroka akilla maxgazu.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Wa min illom Yusif la luúkaam Barnaaba samawu qala wa maqnaata wad atxaadtaraot ta. Wa min ghabilat Laawi qala wa jinsiyat Ghubrisiyat qalat ilu. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Wa garhat qalat ilu wa azbaya wa la qawla amtsáyu wa xantela luúkaam karayu.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Xanaanya wa Safiira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Wa laakiin inaas Xanaanya la litbahal qala wa hitu wa issiitu Safiira garhat azbaw. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Wa gale minna girush xantela luúkaam kara wa kim killu la mablagh attamsalayu. Wa ib mawaafaghat issiitu la taarif baxaatu wadayu.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Wa xare Budtrus belayu, “Igil mi Abliis libka limlá xadagkaahu wa it Rox Ghiddus xasseka wa gale minna qawilla garhat igil nafiska akkabka? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Min iitaázabbiyu, igilka waíigabá? Wa xagho azbekaahu kim shanhatka ibba qawlu igil titnaffaq wiighadarka? Igil mi kiínna wadeka? Inta it addaam yaxasseka, it Rabbi indeíko!”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Wa Xanaanya illa kim samqa inintu arid batsxa wa arwex haba. Wa ibilla la samqaw killom harakat tsabdtsadtom. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wa gale mandaliitaat ghantsaw wa Xanaanya kaffanaw wa asik ghabir rafqawu.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Wa xagho salas saaqat la ghaarib, issiit Xanaanya matsát la jara inde iiddalle. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Ka Budtrus saálaya, “Balini, la garhat ibbilli qawil illi azbekuma?” Ka balsat ittu, “Qaabo, ibbilli qawil azbenaaha.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Ka Budtrus belaya, “Igil mi misil biíski it attamtaxanot Rox Rabbi attafaghki? La abitstsaxat la biíski ghabraw lissaq mangoffa kadanna baab hallaw wa inti ma igil lirfuquki tu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Wa agiidaay ghadam Budtrus wadghat wa motat. Wa la abitstsaxat dolat ataw, maaytat rakbawa ka ginaazata rafqaw wa jafar biísa ghabrawa. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Fijaq saareq it killa la kaniisat tkarra wa it killom la illi kabar samqaw.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">La luúkaam bizxaam shaffu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wa la luúkaam qalamaat wa qajaayib bizxit laájarru qalaw migibba shaqab. Wa killom la emnat gats xid diib Ghaaqat Sulemaan la diibba haykal laájtamaqo qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Wa orot biqid igil litxaabarrom iijarraá, minnaata la shaqab laxashshimmom qala. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Wa qilib emnat ib Molaay twaasaka ib matxabaar sab wa anis ittom. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Wa la addaam la xamayim asikka agbuy raffaqo wa it saawriitaat wa afirshat karriwom qalaw Budtrus inlaxallif qizaalu galehom igil lisaadif wa shifa igil lirkabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Wa maxaabir bizxit minna madayin wa la dagaggiit la ghirbit asik Orshaliim matstsó qalaw xamayim wa arwaax najsat la maalkatom qalat inde raffaqo wa killom lishshaafaw qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirbatta luúkaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Wa riíssa kahana wa jamaaqatu wa hitom la minna mazhabba Saddughiyiin qalaw, wa minna luúkaam ghiirat tsabdtatom. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ka tsabdtawom wa diibba sijin la qaam sajnawom. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Laakiin min gats laali, maláak Rabbi matsá wa baabaatta sijin kaasata wa adtdtallaghayom wa belayom, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Asikka haykal giiso wa igilla addaam liíkatta xayot la xaddaas ib tamaama qalluna.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ka kimma belaya wadaw wa tsibex midir la haykal ataw wa adrasot ambataw.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Wa waan la riíssa kahana wa jamaaqatu matsáw, la Majlis ajtamaqa wa hitu killom qabayi Israíil shammil. Wa ib attamtsaótta luúkaam minna sijin ammaraw. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Wa laakiin la xarassa haykal iirakbawom. Ka qaghbalaw wa la majlis assaálaw <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />wa belaw, “Baabaatta sijin dabí xidtudt dibít ininta rakabnaaha wa la xaras ghadama baadtraam inintom. Minnaata dol kasatnaaha, ghabata orot iirakabna.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Waan illa samqaw masúlla xarassa haykal wa ruásaala kahana faradom ghawaw wa xid saálaw, “Illi amir, mi igil lilad tu?”<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Wa xare inaas matsá asikka majlis wa bela, “La sab la ilom sajankum, aze diibba haykal baadtraam wa addaam laqallimo hallaw.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ka massúla xarassa haykal wa jamaaqatu gesaw wa ibba luúkaam qaghbalaw ib bishesh sabab la shaqab igil iilirjammom farhaw.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Wa dolat ghadamma Majlis attabdtarawom, riíssa kahana igil laáttajwirrom jarraba <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />wa belayom, “Ibbilla simet igil iitqallimo ib tsinoq ammarnaakum wa laakiin ib taqliimkum ibbu Orshaliim malákum wa masúliyat motu igil taqadturuna taxazzu hallekum.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ka Budtrus wa la luúkaam balsaw ittom, “Xina Rabbi igil nidtayaq bina bidaal addaam. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30-31" />Yasoq la intim it saliib salabkumu hitu tu la Rabbi abawna min mot qaghnatsayu wa dimmaanu rafqayu wa Riís wa Mangifaay wadayu igil Israíil tobat wa maghfarat zinub igil lahab. <verse eid="ACT 5:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Wa xina ibbilla inshihid wa la Rox la Ghiddus ma la Rabbi igilla dtayqiwu wahabayu lishhid.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wa la xaadraam qalaw illa higya waan samqaw xarughatom zaayadat wa la luúkaam igil lightalo xazaw. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Laakiin orot Farriisi minna anfaarra Majlis, Ghamaalaaíil la litbahal wa hitu maqallim shariiqat nabra wa killu la shaqab laxashshimu qala. Wa badtra wa ib attafgarotta luúkaam igil xinkato ammara. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Wa xare igilla jimqaam qalaw belayom, “Shaqab Israíil yahaw, min naffazot la ittilli sab igil tidawu naawyaam hallekum daggago. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ghadam maddat Tudaas ghantsa wa kim baqal akaan wighghil tmassala ka qarbaq miít inaas la gabbó talawu wa laakiin tghattala wa telyatu tshattataw wa amru aktama. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Wa xare Yahuza la Jaliili ghantsa waghitta qallabot wa bizxaam ajla igil litlawu minnaata hitu ma halka wa telyatu mikraayom tghawet. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ka min illi inde tbaggasko, illi sab igil titxaagalom inassaxakum wa igil titrako iglom. Wa inkum, la waddiwu hallaw min sittaat nosom min gabbí, it ghirubaat kim yaqala igil ligbaá tu. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Laakiin min Rabbi min gabbí, igil tikriqiwom iitghadro wa bardu intim abbach Rabbi tgabbó.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Wa anfaarra majlis illa nasixat dtabbaghaw. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Wa la luúkaam atlaakaw wa atkarbajawom wa ib simet Yasoq igil iilithaagaw ammarawom. Wa darbu dtallaghawom.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Wa la luúkaam minna Majlis liwughaam inintom fagraw sabab ajil simet Yasoq igil lithayano astahalaw. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Wa kil amqil diibba haykal wa diibba abyaat imbal atkaaraam bashshiro wa laqallimo qalaw Yasoq la Masex kim tu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Xiryaan saboq kedmaay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Wa itta waghit lahay qilibba darasa twaasaka wa la Yahud la Yunaaniyat tithaagaw minna Qibraaniyiin dtarqaw jalla amabbilom xazot minna maqunat la yomiyat lithayaba yaqalaya. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ka la luúkaam la qasir kilót jamaaqatta darasa tlaakaw wa belawom, “Xina zaqat Rabbi igil nixdag wa maqunaat igil nikaafil waajib iiko. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ka xawna, min migibkum saboq inaas simqat ghidiit la bom wa ib Rox Ghiddus wa xikmat miláam xiraw ibbilli waajib igil nattaghnitsom. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Xina laata waghitna it daqa wa kidmat zaqat Rabbi naxaaliffu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ka la jamaaqat killa illi raáy atxayasat. Ka Istifaanus inaas ib emaan wa Rox Ghiddus milú wa Filibbos wa Burxuras wa Niikaanur wa Tiimun wa Barmiinaas wa Niigulaawas la Andtaaki la mathawid xaraw. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Wa asikka luúkaam aghaddamawom igil liddaqaw ilom wa ideyom igil likraw ittom.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ka zaqat Rabbi diib intishaar zaayadat wa diib Orshaliim qilibba darasa twaasaka. Wa bizxaam minna kahanala Yahud la emaan ib killa albaabom ghablaw.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matstsabaadt Istifaanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Istifaanus baqal niqimat wa xiilat qala wa migibba shaqab qajaayib wa muqjizaat riít wadde qala. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Wa gale minna anfaarra Maqbad la ib Agbir la Qitughaam litámmaro la naayya Yahud la min Al Ghayrawaan wa la Askandariya qaaradawu. Wa biqidaam min aghaaliim Kiliikiya wa Aasya saanudom qalaw wa igil litkaxodu astabdaw. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Laakiin xikmatu wa la Rox la ibbu lithaage qala igil lighaawmo iighadraw. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ka igil gale anfaar rashwat dafqaw igil laxassu ittu wa igil libalo, “Istifaanus Musa wa Rabbi inde sabbib samqanaahu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ka ibbilla tihmat la shaqab wa sabba gats wa qilamala shariiqat it Istifaanos fatnaw ka tsabdtawu wa asikka Majlis amtsáwu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wa shahaadat zur ashhadaw ittu wa belaw, “Illi nafar, matárraad itta haykal la ghiddus wa itta shariiqat iilaátkaarim. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Xina Yasoq la Naasiri illi haykal igil laxanfis tu wa la afittaxat la min Musa tkabbatnaaha igil lighayir tu inlibil samqanaahu,” belaw. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wa killom la itta Majlis xaadram qalaw gatstsu fazzaw wa kimsal gats maláak traáyom.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kidtbat Istifaanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ka riíssa kahana igil Istifaanus, “Illi amaan tu?” belayu.<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Ka balsa, “Xaw wa abaw yahaw, simqo. Rabbila qizzat it abuna Ibraahiim abhaza itta ardat la finge kilé la nahar inintu ghadam it Xaaraan xadiiru. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Wa belayu, ‘Baladka wa adhuyka xidag wa asikka ardat la ila arékka gaqaz.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imbutat 12:1</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ka min balad la Kaldaaniyiin naghla wa it Xaaraan sakna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:4">Wa xagho abuhu mota Rabbi asik illa ardat la aze intim xaadraama hallekum ankasayu <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />wiris inde iilahayibbu itta aw mikraay igir. Minnaata Rabbi kim milik igilu wa igil ziryattu girraahu kim waddiya waqadayu waalid ma min iilaqale. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Wa bardu belayu, ‘Ziryatka it ardat gaana igil tiskan tu wa igil litgabbaro tu wa igil qarabaq miít sanat akay maghrex igil lignaxom tu. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Wa laakiin la shaqab la ilom laáttagbir igil qaaghibbu tu. Wa xare minna ardat laha fagro wa ittilla akaan iyye laqabdo.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Wa Rabbi igil Ibraahiim galad kishbo bayá iglu. Wa Ibraahiim Isxaagh walda wa itta amqil la saamnayit akshabayu. Wa Isxaagh Yaqghub akshaba wa Yaqghub ma la abaw la qasir kilót akshaba.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Wa la abaw la salfaayaam Yusif xuhom xasdaw ka azbawu wa asik Masir attamtsáwu. Laakiin Rabbi mislu qala <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />wa min killa masaaybu najjayu wa it gats Firqon malik Masir niqimat wa xikmat habayu. Ka Firqon it Masir wa it ghasru wallayu.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Wa it Masir killa wa Kanqaan majaaqat wa siddit saamqaat tkarraya ka abawna munat saánaw. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Wa Yaqghub diib Masir ikil kim halla samqa ka abawna asik ken laáka dolatta salif. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Wa itta dolat la kaaláyit, Yusif misil xawu taámara wa farqu igil Firqon tbayyana. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Ka Yusif abuhu Yaqghub wa killa qashiratu tlaaka wa sabqa wa xamis nafar qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ka Yaqghub asik Masir darra wa hitu wa abawna diiba motaw. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Wa asik Shakiim nasáwom wa diibba ghabir la Ibraahiim zaabayu diib Shakiim ib qilib min maal min wilaad Xamur ghabrawom.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Wa dolat waqad Rabbi la Ibraahiim waqada ibbu igil litxaghghagh gharba, shaqabna diib Masir twaasaka <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />asik diib Masir malik biqid Yusif la iilaámmir tshayama. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ka did shaqabna makra wa abawna aaza wa agruzom igil mot igil lilkafo tjabbaraw.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Wa itta waghit lahey Musa twallada wa sanni girrum qala. Ka diib bet abuhu igil salas warex ambatbata. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Wa waan qaddu aremawu, walat Firqon adxanatu wa tbannetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ka xikimatta Masriyiin killa taqallama wa it ghol wa it widdaay ghedraay qala.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Wa waan qimru qarbaqa sanat gabá la xawu la Israíiliyiin igil ligaanex taghab belayu. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Wa orohom Masri inlitqadde ittu dolat raá igil laáttakriyu matsá wa taratu tfadda ilu wa la Masri tarkasha. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Wa jaldatu Rabbi kim ibbu najjiyom lifhumo laxassib qala minnaata iifahamawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Wa tsibbixita kilót minnom inlitbaáso xawatsa wa igil laátqaariyom jarraba. Wa belayom, ‘Wilaad sab, intim xaw intim. Igil mi it xid jawro?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Laakiin la inaas la ayaayu madrir qala Musa aroh ashkata, ‘Wa min riís wa ghaadi qayyanekka itna?’ belayu. <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />‘Igil tightalanni taxazzi halleka kimma la Masri ghatalkaaha maale?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Wa ibbilla Musa min Masir harba asik ardat Midyaan wa kim gaana nabraya. Wa kilót wal walda diiba.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Wa xagho qarbaqa sanat, diib dangarat Dabir Siiná maláak diib haab isaat min kitkittotat taxaye xawatsa ittu. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ka Musa illa riíyat dol raá taqajjaba wa min ghirub igil lignax ghaddama. Wa kirin Molaay samqa, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ana Rabbi abawka ana, Rabbi Ibraahiim wa Rabbi Isxaagh wa Yaqghub.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matqaddaay 3:6</char></note> Ka Musa qarqada wa bal igil laábil yaábtaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ka Molaay belayu, ‘Isíinka xiradt ajil la akaan la itta baadtir halleka ardat ghiddisit gabát.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matqaddaay 3:5</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ana macaghaadt shaqabye diib Masir reéko wa aniinu samqako. Ka igil inajjiyu tkarreko. Ka naqa asik Masir igil ilaá kakka.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matqaddaay 3:7-8, 10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Ka Musa la shaqabu nakrayu wa belayu, ‘Min riís wa ghaadi qayyanekka itna?’ hitu tu la Rabbi kim riís wa manajjiyaay laákayu ibba sadayitta maláak la diibba kitkittotat abhaza ittu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ka la shaqab min Masir afgara ibba qajaayib wa la qalaamaat la diib Masir diib Baxar Ghayax wa diibba baadobat wadaya it maddat qarbaqa sanat.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Wa hitu nosu tu la igilla Israíiliyiin, ‘Rabbi min finge shaqabkum nabi kimsaleye igil qaghnits ikkum tu,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tasniya 18:15</char></note> bela. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Wa Musa la misil abawna, jamaaqat Israíil, la diibba baadobat la maláak it Dabir Siiná tahaagayu wa zaqat xayot tkabbata asikna igil laxaaliffa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Laakiin abawna tawnakaw minnu wa qasawu. Wa aremawu wa albaabom asik Masir twallabat. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ka igil Haarun, ‘Aalihat ghadamena taherir wide inna sabab Musa la min Masir afgarenna mi kim jara ilu iidalena,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matqaddaay 32:1</char></note> belawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ka itta waghit lahay sanam it surat laga sanqaw wa xarayid ghaddamaw ilu wa ibba la ideyom shaghettu lawagh aráw. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ka Rabbi ken belayom wa igil qibaadat kawaakib azma minnom kimma diibba kitaabba nabyaat tkattaba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Yahaw Israíiliyiin, diibba dangarat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">igilye tu la igil maddat qarbaqa sanat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">karaamaat wa gharaabiin ghaddamkum?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Bidaalu kemat Muluk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">la sanam rafqakum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">wa kokab ilaahkum Rimfaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">la timsaalaat la igil tisjado</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ila sanqakuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Sababu asik min ken Baabil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">igil infaykum tu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qaamus 5:25 - 27</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Wa abawna diibba dangarat kematta shahaadat rafqaw baakom. Wa Rabbi igil Musa ibba gabey la hitu aráyu ta igil liidaya ammarayu. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Wa xare abawna la kemat tmallakaw wa asik illi balad la ib marex Yashuq fatxawu ataw ibba Rabbi la shuqub la saaknata qalat min ghadamehom inliddaagan. Wa la kemat diib illi balad taákkabat asik ayaam Daawid <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />la min Rabbi niqimat rakba wa igil Rabbi Yaqghub maátey igil lindtagh dtalba. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Minnaata la igil Rabbi bet nadgha, Sulemaan qala.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Laakiin La Wighghul diib hayaakkil ib idey bashar shighiit iisakkin kimma Molaay ibba affa nabi belaya:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘La qastar qarishshe ta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">wa la midir mikraay qighibye tu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Mi bet tnadgho iyye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Aw mi akaan qirif taádaalu iyye?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ideye iiko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:50">la illi killu sanqat?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishqiya 66:1-2 </char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Wa asaru Istifaanus bela, “Wo sab asigdat tsinqit wa sab albaab wa izan xilalaataat! Intim diima la Rox Ghiddus tghaawmo; kimsalla abawkum wadawa, twaddu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ka ayi nabi min atkalabaatom nagfa? Hitom la ibba mitsátta Saalex ma tnabbaáw ghaatalawom. Wa intim it ide karekumu wa ghatalkumu. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Intim la shariiqat min idey malaíkat tkabbatkuma laakiin iidtayaqkuma.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rajim Istifaanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wa waan anafaarra majlis illi samqaw ghaharaw wa xaraatsatsaw ittu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Wa Istifaanus ib Rox Ghiddus milú inintu asik sama anghaqarara wa xaban Rabbi raá wa Yasoq dimmaan Rabbi baadtir raá. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Wa bela, “Baab sama fitox wa Wadda Aadami dimmaan Rabbi baadtir iríyu halleko.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ka mawqi serakaw wa izanom daabáw wa xatte hijmat hajmaw ittu. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Wa minna madiinat asikka kadan daarakawu wa ib iman igil lirjomu ambataw. Wa la shuhud balalliitom xaaradtaw wa xante qaaghaab mandalaay Shaawul la litbahal karawa igil liqighabba.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Wa Istifaanus inrajjumu liddeqe qala wa libil, “Wo Molaay Yasoq, arwaxachche tkabbat.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Wa darbu tgarmaxa wa ib kirin wighghil dtarxa wa bela, “Molaay, illi zanib iitxissabu ittom.” Wa illa bela wa arwex haba.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Wa Shaawul it ghatil Istifaanus wufugh qala.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Shaawul la emnat laátkalaabit</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Wa itta amqil laha la emnat diib Orshaliim ib matkalaabaat saareq gaaylo qalaw. Ka imballa luúkaam killom shattataw diib jahaat Yahudiya wa Saamira. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wa sab ferhat Rabbi Istifaanus ghabraw wa laaghis simoq wadaw ilu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Wa Shaawul akrabotta kaniisat litxaaze qala. Wa min bet asik bet gayis wa sab wa anis lisxib wa asik sijin sayimmom qala.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabshiir diib Saamira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Wa kiínna la emnat la tshattataw min akaan it akaan litnaakaso wa ib zaqat Rabbi bashshiro qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Ka Filibbos asik madiinat diib Saamira darra wa bashsharot ib Al Masex astabda diiba. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Wa la maxaabir ib oro lib zaqatu attanset jalla la qajayib samqatta wa reétta. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Wa la arwaax la najsat ib kirin wighghil dtarrex wa minna bizxaam la saaknatom qalat taáwalwil qalat. Kimsalhuma bizxaam minna shilulaam wa la xanakkish tshaffaw. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Wa diibba madiinat farxat riít xadrat.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Igil maddat shaxartaay Samqaan la litbahal nabraya wa albaab sab Saamira nassí wa laqul litmassal qala. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Wa killom lib karaw ilu min niúshom asik qabihom. Wa liblo qalaw, “Illi inaas ib raateq, ‘Xiilat Rabbi la Daaghbat’ tbahala.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wa izin karaw ilu ajil ibba wadaddiitu la shaxartayit min waghit sanni albaabom saaliba qala. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Laakiin xagho Filibbos ib mamlakat Rabbi wa ib simet Yasoq Al Masex bashsharayom, liíkatu amnaw wa sabóm wa ansom taqammadaw. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Wa Samqaan ma amna wa taqammada wa Filibbos taxawara wa la muqjizaat wa la mistinkiraat xaaylat la ila laájarre qala raá ka xiirat nasáttu.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wa la luúkaam diib Orshaliim la Saamiriyiin zaqat Rabbi kim ghablaw samqaw ka Budtrus wa Yuxanna laákaw ittom. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ka dolat Saamira batsxaw daqaw ilom Rox Ghiddus igil litkabbato <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ajil lissaq it oro minnom kiruy yaqala, hitom ib simet Molaay Yasoq ledta qimmudaam qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Xaariit ideyom kaaraw ittom ka Rox Ghiddus tkabbataw.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Wa Samqaan dol la Rox Ghiddus ib kari idey luúkaam itta emnat litkarre raá, it Budtrus wa Yuxanna gale maal qarda <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />wa belayom, “Igilye ma illa sildtat habuni itta ideyye ikarre ittu Rox Ghiddus igil litkabbat.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Budtrus balsa ittu, “Girushka misilka tihlak sabab wahabat Rabbi ib girush igil tizaabe fakkarka! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Diib illa kidmat kiflat aw ghismat alabka ajil libka jahat Rabbi muklis iigabá. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ka min illa kelmiitka tobe wa it Rabbi daqe qasaalla laqaghaffir ikka ib sabab miraad libka <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />jalliib libka ib maraarat milú wa zanib ghiyudka iréka halleko.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Ka Samqaan bela, “Intim it Rabbi daqaw iyye la ilu tibaw igil iilirkabanni!”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Xaghohu Budtrus wa Yuxanna ib zaqat Molaay shahadaw wa ken qallanawa asik Orshaliim qaghbalaw ibba bishaarat inbashshiro diib dagaggit bizxit diib Saamira.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibbos wa la waziir la Xibishtaay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Wa xare maláak Molaay Filibbos tahaaga wa belayu, “Kib bal wa jahat giblat giis ibba gabeyya sabbot la finge Orshaliim wa Ghazza inteherir.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Wa kib wada wa gesa wa itta gabey inaas Xibishtaay sorat wazzir killa kazayin Kandaaka, malikat Xabasha tsaabidt rakba. Wa asik Orshaliim gaayis qala igil liqibad diiba. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Wa asik Al Xabasha inlaqaghabbil it markibatu tsiqun inintu wa kitaab nabi Ishaqayá ingharrí. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ka la Rox Ghiddus igil Filibbos belayu, “Kamkam wa asik leha markibat giis wa jafara tsinax.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Ka Filibbos asikka markibat asrada wa la sorat nibiwat Ishaqayá ingharrí samqa. Ka saálayu, “La tigharrú halleka tifhimmu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ka balsa, “Kafo ifhim nafar inde iisharrex iyye?” Wa Filibbos qazma itta markibat igil liqirag wa igil litgasse baaku. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Wa la sorat ghisimma Kitaab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Kimsal biggiqit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">asik xirdo tgelala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">wa kimsal qiyot aazim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">it ide macaggiraayu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">afuhu iikasta.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wa zilul inintu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">min qadaalat taxarrama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Min ib ziryatu laákabbir?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Jallaab xayotu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">min midir nassaát,” gharrí qala.<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Wa la sorat Filibbos saála, “Assiílanni, ibbilla bahalat, la nabi it min laxabbir qala? It nosu ma it nafar biqid?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ka Filibbos diib illi kitub inde attankaba ib Yasoq igil libashshirru astabda.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Wa insaafro akaan maay batsxaw wa la sorat bela, “Ginax! Illi maay tu. Ka min matqamaad mi karraqanni?” [<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diib mabzex la sijillaat la ghaadiimat illa aayat yiínrakibba. </char></note>Ka Filibbos basla ittu, “Illi litghaddar ib killu libka min taámmin.” Ka la sorat bela, “Yasoq Al Masex kim Wad Rabbi tu ammin.”] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Wa la markibat igil tibdtar ammara wa misil diibba maay tkarraw wa Filibbos qammadayu. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Wa kim fagraw minnu inintu Rox Molaay faját Filibbos gala ka la sorat ib digmaan iiraáyu wa ib lawagh safaru attalaala. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Minnaata Filibbos diib Ashdud traá wa diib killa la madayin inbashshir saafara asik Ghaysariiya batsxa.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Amiin Shaawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shaawul laata ib tahdiid ib ghatil didda darasa laáddafaaris qala. Wa asikka riíssa kahana gesa <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />wa jawaabaat asik maqaabid Dimashgh igil asiir telyat Gabey Yasoq min tabqat aw anis la ken rakkibbom dtalba minnu wa inde tghayadaw asik Orshaliim igil laámtsaóm.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Wa jahat Dimashgh inlidtdtallagh waan shaágaya ammat alaba min qastar birhaan barha ittu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Ka it arid wadgha wa kirin samqa intibil, “Shaawul, Shaawul, igil mi taátkalaabtanni halleka?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ka bela, “Inta min inta mamba?” Ka balsa ittu, “Ana Yasoq la inta taátkalaabittu halleka ana. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ghinats wa la madiinat ite wa la ilu igil tiide bika igil litbahalakka tu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wa la baak Shaawul saafro qalaw taxayaraw wa imbal manghamo ghasaw. La kirin samqaw laakiin orot iiraáw. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Shaawul minna arid kib bela wa qintaatu dolat fatxa xijjub rakbayu. Ka asik Dimashgh tetawu. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Wa it maxajjab salas amqil tsanxa wa iibalqa wa iisata.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Wa diib Dimashgh darasaay Xanaanya la litbahal qala wa diib rúya Molaay adhayu, “Wo Xanaanya!” Ka, “Illi ana Molaay,” belayu. <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ka Molaay ammarayu, “Jahat bet Yahuza giis asikka sharreq la ib Raateq litámmar wa inaas min Dtarsus Shaawul litsamme asarbib. Hitu ken liddeqe halla <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />wa diib rúya inaas Xanaanya la litbahal matstsú wa ideyu karre ittu raá raáyatu igil liblas ittu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Wa Xanaanya ib iifaal balsa, “Molaayye, ana min bizxaam ibba wadaddiit la makrahat la illi inaas diib Orshaliim itta ghiddusaamka wadaya samqako. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Wa hitu minna ruásaala kahana ib amir matsá killu la ib simetka liddeqe igil litsbadt.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Minnaata Molaay igil Xanaanya belayu, “Giis! Illi inaas giraab simechche asikka umam wa la miluk wa wilaad Israíil igil lirfaq xarekowu. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Wa ajil simechche akil ayi kim matstsits igil aríyu tu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Wa xare Xanaanya asikka bet gesa wa ataya wa ideyu it Shaawul kara wa bela, “Xu Shaawul yaha, Molaay Yasoq la itta gabey insar inde tmatstsí abhaza itka, laákenni itka ib xadiis igil tiré wa ib Rox Ghiddus igil titmallá.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Wa bagiidaay sanqat xirfaaf massil min qintaat Shaawul wadghat wa ib digmaan igil liré ghadra. Wa ghantsa wa taqammada. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Wa xagho gale nabra balqa rex balsa wa diib Dimashgh amqelaat nasá misilla darasa.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shaawul ib Yasoq bashshir diib Dimashgh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Wa agiidaay diib maqaabid Yasoq Wad Rabbi kim tu igil libashshir astabda. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wa killom la samqawu aghatsaw wa attsaálaw, “Illi inaas la diib Orshaliim la did illa simet la raffaqo ib ghinuts ghannits qala iiko? Wa insar asikka ruásaala kahana kim xibusaam igil linsaóm iimatsá?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Shaawul laata ghidrat twassaka wa la Yahud la diib Dimashgh saaknaam afachtom qatsbadtayom ajil Yasoq kim la Masex tu barhana.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Wa xagho amqilotaat la Yahud muámarat xabkaw Shaawul igil lightalo. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Laakiin Shaawul ibba sittaatom kashfa. Wa manaagí la madiinat raaghbo qalaw amqil wa laali infaggir minna igil lightolu. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Minnaata xawratu ib laali nasáwu wa diib giffat karawu wa minna xisinna madiinat ib xibaal adnanawu.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shaawul diib Orshaliim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Wa Shaawul waan Orshaliim batsxa misilla darasa igil litxaabar jarraba laakiin killom farhawu wa kim darasaay Molaay gabá yaámnawu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Laakiin Barnaaba nasáyu wa asikka luúkaam amtsáyu wa kafo Molaay itta gabey kim abhaza ittu wa tahaagayu wa ib bataakat ib simet Yasoq diib Dimashgh kim bashshara akbarayom.<verse eid="ACT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ka Shaawul baakom tsanxa ib xirriyat bayí wa faggir wa diib Orshaliim ib simet Molaay ib bataakat inbashshir. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Wa la Yahud la Yunaaniyiin kaadtib wa litkaxaddom qala ka igil lightolu wadtdtanaw. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Wa la emnat ibbilli dol samqaw asik miiná Ghaysariiya darrawu ibbu wa min ken asik Dtarsus nadáwu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Wa itta waghit lahay la kaniisat diib manaadtigh Al Yahudiya wa Al Jaliil wa Saamira ib salaam titmattaq qalat. Wa taqabbe wa ib taghwat Molaay tnabbir qalat ib masnado Rox Ghiddus.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Budtrus diib Ludda wa Yaafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Wa Budtrus min akaan asik akaan inde litnaakas, emnat madiinat Ludda gaanxa. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ken shilul Iiniyaas la litbahal rakba wa firaash tsaabidt inintu samaan sanat kaalí qala. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ka belayu, “Wo Iiniyaas, Yasoq Al Masex shafekka. Ghinats firaashka jayih.” Ka itta waghtu ghantsa. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wa killom sikkaan Ludda wa Shaarun raáwu ka it Molaay tobaw.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Wa diib madiinat Yaafa darasayit Dtaabiisa titbahal qalat, ib Yunaaniyat Dorkaas. Wa diima qamal ker twadde wa gidqaam sadde qalat. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Wa itta maddat laha xammat wa motat. Ka xatsbawa wa diibba odat itta darrajat la laqaaliit karawa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Wa la darasa diib Yaafa Budtrus ghirub diib Ludda kim halla samqaw ka kilót inaas laákaw ittu wa balawu, “Mitsánna wa iitaaddig!”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Wa Budtrus gesa gorom wa dol batsxa, asikka odat la qaalyayit marxawu. Wa la mablaat killan madtoru badtraya inbakya wa gale minna gamayis wa la lababbis la biqidat la Dorkaas shaafadtata mislan waan qalat inlaríyaahu.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Budtrus killom minna odat afgarayom wa asaru abraka wa daqa. Wa asikka issiit la maaytat inde twallaba, “Yahey Dtaabiisa, ghinatsi,” bela. Wa hita qintaata fatxat wa Budtrus kim raét gissaya gabát. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Wa hitu ib idha nasáya wa sandaya bidtaara igil tigbá. Wa xare la emnat wa la mablaat atlaaka wa ib xiyaaya amtsaáya iglom. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Illi diib killa Yaafa tnashshara wa bizxaam ib Molaay amnaw. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Budtrus igil gale waghit diib Yaafa tsanxa baak meqesaay Samqaan la litbahal.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Budtrus wa Karnilyos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Diib Ghaysariiya inaas Karnilyos la litbahal qala wa hitu merxaay miít naayya katibat la ib Idtaaliyat titámmar qala. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Wa hitu wa killom dtewaahu taghiyiin wa ferhat Rabbi qalaw wa igilla xiguzaam ib tsiggot lissaddagh qala wa it Rabbi ib tululuy liddaqe nabra.<verse eid="ACT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Wa amqil xatte taghaarib saaqat salas xagho addihir rúya raá; maláak Rabbi ib ghiloq asku inlaátte raá. Wa, “Wo Karnilyos,” belayu. <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Wa Karnilyos la maláak fazza wa farhat tsabdtattu wa saálayu, “Molaay, mi halla?” Ka balsa ittu, “Daqaaka wa sadaghaatka asik Rabbi kim fighghadiit ghadam twaghghalaw. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Ka aze asik Yaafa sab laák, Samqaan la Budtrus litkanne igil litlaakaw <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />wa hitu baak Samqaan la meqesaay la betu jafarra baxar aati halla.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Wa la maláak la tahaagayu kim taxayyaba, Karnilyos kilót minna shaghghalaahu wa jindihu la taghi la minna xawratu tlaaka. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Wa ib killu la kabar akbarayom wa asik Yaafa nadáyom.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Wa tsibbixiita la salas inaas madiinat Yaafa xiin shaágaw, taghaarib addihir Budtrus asikka qarish qarga igil liddeqe. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Wa safra wa nabra shannaha. Wa la nabra intiddaale jazabat tsabdtatu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Wa la sama fitxit raáya wa sanqat cirraamat faayxat massil ib qarbaq rikina tsibdtit wa asik arid dihir raá. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Wa ib kil ajnaas xewaanaat la ib qarbaq taakish wa la lemmat wa la sarayir milít. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Wa kirin tlaaket wa tellu, “Kib de Budtrus, xirad wa bilaq!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Laakiin Budtrus balsa ittu, “Bataatan abajá, Molaay! Ana xirrum aw najis baaleq yaána.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Wa la kirin inde dagmat telattu, “Rabbi la adtharayu, inta najis iitismayu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Wa illi salas dol jara wa la cirraamat agiid asik qastar traffaqat.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Wa Budtrus xiyur inintu wa ibba maqnatta rúya nafsu inlissaál, la sab la Karnilyos laákayom ib bet Samqaan la meqesaay inlaáttasílo affa maáte badtraw <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />wa tkaabaraw, “Samqaan la Budtrus litkanne insar kiruy halla?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Wa itta maddat laha Budtrus maqnatta rúya laáttasalsil qala, wa la Rox Ghiddus belayu, “Affa maáte salas inaas ikka laxazzu hallaw. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ka kib de tkarre wa inde iitaámakaalí giis mislom, ana tu la laákkowom.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ka Budtrus tkarra wa belayom, “Ana tu la iglu taxazzu hallekum. Mi amtseékkum?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ka la sab balsaw ittu, “Xina Karnilyos merxaayya miít laákenna. Wa hitu inaas saalex wa ferhaay Rabbi tu wa la shaqab la Yahudi killu laáxtarrimmu. Maláak ghiddus asik betu igil laáttamtsaákka xabbarayu la bikaatu igil lismaq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Asaru Budtrus diibba bet igil litmayo taxaddarayom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Wa fajrata mislom tbaggasa wa gale xaw min Yaafa taalawu. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Tsibbixiita Ghaysariiya batsxaw. Wa Karnilyos ayaayaatu wa galaggilu adha ajil mitsátom sií qala. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Wa Budtrus kim ata inintu Karnilyos tkabbatayu wa sajda ilu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Laakiin Budtrus qaghnatsayu wa, “Bidtaarka gibá, ana aadami kimsaleka daám ana,” belayu.<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Wa Budtrus inlithaageyu karis ata wa maxaabir jimqit rakba. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ka belayom, “Intim amaxbarot baak Yahudi la iigabá aw diib betu igil litgashannu misil shariiqatna kim liddaagash taámro. Laakiin Rabbi igil aadami kisox aw najis igil yiíbal arénni. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Sababu dolat dtalabkuni, imbal girfa matsaáko. Ka igil issaál, sababba likya mi qala?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Wa Karnilyos balsa, “Itta qarbaq amqil la xalfaya ittilli waghit gona saaqat salas xagho addihir diib bechche iddeqe qalako. Wa faját inaas billaay tsaqda baarih laabis ghadameye badtra. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Wa belenni, ‘Abretka Karnilyos, Rabbi daqaaka samqa wa sadaghaatka faghda. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Asik Yaafa sab laák Samqaan la Budtrus litkanne igil litlaakaw. Hitu it gishinnat Samqaan la meqesaay halla jafarra baxar.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ka it bagaayid laákko itka wa sanni wadeka matsáka. Wa illa aze kilna insar hallena it xidur Rabbi killu la Molaay ammareka ibbu igil nismaq.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qizat Budtrus diib bet Karnilyos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ka Budtrus qizatu astabda wa bela, “Aze barha iyye ib xagh wa xaghiighat Rabbi mafaargaay kim iiko. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Hitu di min kil ummat la farruhu wa la raateq wadde ghabbil. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Rabbi liíkatu asikka Israíiliyiin laáka ibba bisharatta salaam ib gabey Yasoq Al Masex Molaay killu igil laxabbir. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />La diib Yahudiya killa jara wa diib Al Jaliil la ambata xagho la maqmudiyat la Yuxunna anaada ibba aamraam hallekum. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Wa Rabbi Yasoq la Naasiri ib Rox Ghiddus wa xiilat kim masxa taámro. Ka min akaan asik akaan inlitnaakas sannet inwadde killom la xante cighdto Abliis qalaw shaffa jalla Rabbi mislu qala.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Wa xina it killu la diib balad Yahud wa diib Orshaliim wadayu shawahiid xina. Wa it qiccat saghlawu igil lightolu. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Minnaata Rabbi it saalis amqil min mot qaghnatsayu wa kim litreé wadayu. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Killu la addaam iiko la raáyu, bas la shawaahiid la Rabbi badiir xarayom bahalat xina la mislu balqana wa satena xagho min mot ghantsa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Hitu la shaqab igil nibashshir ammarena wa hitu tu la Rabbi kim ghaadi xiyayaam wa maaytaam wadayu inshihid. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Killom la nabyaat lishhido kim ibbu la laámmin killu ib gabeyu maghfirat zinub kim rakkib.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabte umam igil Rox Ghiddus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Wa Budtrus illi inlibil la Rox Ghiddus it killom la zaqat sammoqo qalaw tkarra. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wa la emnat la Yahud la baak Budtrus matsáw astadmamaw ajil la Rox Ghiddus itta umammiyiin kim wahabat tkarra <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />jalliib ib hagaggiit biqidat inlithaagaw wa Rabbi inlaxamdo samqawom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Xare Budtrus bela, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Illi shaqab min matqammaad ib maay la karreq halla? Hitom la Rox Ghiddus tkabbataw kimma intilena.” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ka igil ib simet Yasoq Al Masex igil litqammado ammara. Wa xare hitom Budtrus baakom amqelaat igil liklá dtalbaw minnu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wa la luúkaam wa la xaw diib Al Yahudiya la Yahud la iigabáw ma zaqat Rabbi tkabbataw samqaw. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ka Budtrus asik Orshaliim waan qaghbala emnatta kishbo atgaalalawu <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />wa belawu, “Inta bet xilalaataat ateka wa balqaka gorom!”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ka Budtrus ib isirur la jara sharxa ilom wa bela, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Diib madiinat Yaafa iddeqe qalko wa jazabat tkarret ichche wa diib rúya sanqat cirraamat waasqat massil ib qarbaq rikina tsibdtit min qastar asikye intijjarbab reékowa. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Wa dolat shimuy ganxakowa ajnaassa xaywaanaat la ib qarbaq taakish wa la aawaat wa la lemmat wa la sarayir reéko. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Wa kirin samqako wa telanni, ‘Wo Budtrus, kib de, xirad wa bilaq.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ka balasko, ‘Bataatan abajá Molaay! Diib afuye sanqat xirrim aw najsat laawish yaána.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ka la kirin la qastariyat ib xadiis, ‘Rabbi la adtharayu, inta najis iitismayu,’ belat. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Wa illi salas dol tkarrara wa xare killu asik qastar tsaxaba.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Wa asaru la salas inaas la min Ghaysariiya tlaákaw ichche itta betta xidrinnachche attabdtaraw. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Wa la Rox imbal atmakaalót igil igiis gorom ammarenni. Bardu illom sis xu talawni wa betta inaas atena. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Wa assaálenna ib kafo maláak diib betu abhaza wa belayu, ‘Asik Yaafa laák wa Samqaan la Budtrus litkanne atlaake. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Wa hitu liíkat igil lijlab ikka tu ibba inta wa dtewaaka killom tnagfo.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Wa waan igil ithaage ambatko Rox Ghiddus tkarra ittom kimma la itna tkarraya ib salif. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Wa xare la Molaay belayu faghadko, ‘Yuxanna ib maay qammada laakiin intim ib Rox Ghiddus igil titqammado tu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ka Rabbi nafsa la wahabat la inna habaya xahgo habayom, xina la ib Molaay Yasoq Al Masex amanna, ana min inde gaáko Rabbi itqaarad?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Illi waan samqaw maghaawamatom aktamat wa Rabbi xammadaw, “Ka Rabbi igilla umammiyiin ma tobat igil rakiib xayot mannaxayom.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaniisat Andtaakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Minnaata la ibba sababba matkalaabaat la misil matrajjaam Istifaanus litásaasar tfandtaraw Finiighiya wa Ghubrus wa Andtaakya batsxaw wa hitom ibba liíkat la Yahud kaw bashshiro qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Gale min Ghubrus wa Al Ghayrawaan laata Andtaakya batsxaw wa la Yunaaniyiin igil lithaagaw astabdaw wa ib bishaarat Molaay Yasoq assaálawom. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Wa ide Molaay baakom qalat wa bizxaam amnaw wa it Molaay tobaw.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Wa kabar illi kaniisat Orshaliim batsxa ka Barnaaba asik Andtaakya laákaw. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Wa waan batsxa wa daliil niqimat Rabbi raá farxa wa killom atxaadtara diib Molaay igil lisbato ib killa albaabom. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Wa hitu inaas sanni wa ib Rox Ghiddus wa emaan miló qala. Wa addaam bizxaam ib Molaay amnaw.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Asar illi Barnaaba asik Dtarsus twajjaha Shaawul igil lixize. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Wa dolat rakbayu asik Andtaakya matsá ibbu wa igil sanat ib gidiida Barnaaba wa Shaawul baakka kaniisat laájtamqo wa maxaabir laqallimo qalaw. Wa diib Andtaakya la darasa Masixiyiin igil lissammaw astabdaw.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ittilli waghit illi gale nabyaat min Orshaliim asik Andtaakya darraw. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Wa fingehom nabi Aghaabus la litbahal qala. Ka bidtaaru gabá wa ib waxey min Rox ib majaaqat daaghbat killa la idduniya tshammil tnabbaá. (Wa illi it waghit shiimat Kuludiyus tamma.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Jalliib illi la darasa kil minnomka qadad ghidratu igil litbarraq igilla xaw la diib Al Yahudiya gharraraw. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Wa illi ib laákot sadaghaatom asikka sabba gats ib ide Barnaaba wa Shaawul wadawu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Astashhadot Yaqghub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Itta waghit lahay Malik Hirudos galela anfaarra kaniisat laqadtarris qala. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wa Yaqghub xu Yuxanna sayyafa. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Wa illi la Yahud laáradde dolat raá, bardu Budtrus igil litsbadt gharrara wa illi it waghit Qiid Fadtiir jara. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Wa xagho tsabdtayu, sajnayu wa igil qarbaq dawriyat min qarbaq xaras sallamayu igil liqighobu. Wa ib qalan igil laátxaakimmu sittut qala xagho Qiid Matqaadaay. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ka Budtrus diibba sijin taxabbasa laakiin la kaniisat ib qadtam it Rabbi tiddeqe ilu qalat.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Budtrus min sijin laharrib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />La laali la xaghoha Hirudos Budtrus igil la xikim igil lisallim naawi qala, Budtrus finge kilót jinde saakib qala ib kilé silsilat ghiyud inintu. Wa ghadamma baabba sijin jinud qeghbat qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Wa faját maláak Molaay abhaza wa nur diibba xaraasat xaya. Wa simidt Budtrus kamha wa attaxasosayu wa, “Agiid ghinats,” belayu. Wa la kilé silsilat min ideyu wadghaya. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ka la maláak, “Mandtagatka anshidt wa madaaska de,” belayu. Wa Budtrus kimsalehu wada. Wa asaru, “Bilaayka twanzaf wa tilenni,” belayu.<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Ka Budtrus minna sijin fagra asarra maláak, wa la maláak waddiyu qala kim xaghighat iitraáyu wa rúya maslayu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wa la qeghbat la awalayaam wa la kaláayaam xalfaw wa itta mangaátta xatsiin la asikka madiinat nassí matsáw. Wa ib nosa tfattaxat ilom wa xalfaw ibba. Wa shaareq orot kim kallasaw, faját la maláak tfantayu. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Wa xare Budtrus qaghlu tkarra ittu wa bela, “Aze tiyaghghanko Molaay maláaku kim laáka wa min tsibdto Hirudos wa min killu la Yahud littaakawu qalaw attarxenni.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Wa illi taghab kim belayu asik bet Maryam im Yuxanna, la Marghos litkanne twajjaha. Wa ken bizxaam minna emnat jimqaam wa liddaqaw qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Budtrus la maáte la mingof kadan karkaxa wa waddayit Rawda titbahal matsát igil taáttanaase. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Wa waan kirin Budtrus alelet iifatxat min bizxe farxata. Wa asikka ghabatta bet saqet wa la xaadraam bashsharat Budtrus itta mangaát kim halla. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ka, “Inti hagayin tithaage halleki,” belawa. Wa kim asarrat, “Maláak Budtrus igil ligbá bu,” belaw.<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Laakiin Budtrus karkaxot attalaala asik fatxaw ilu. Wa dolat raáwu aghatsáw. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ka ib idehu igil liízamo ashshara wa ib kafo Molaay min sijin kim afgarayu assaálayom. Wa bela, “Ibbilli Yaqghub wa la xaw assiílo.” Wa darbu fagra wa asik akaan biqidat gesa.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Wa fajrata finge la jinud shawsharat daayqat sammaqat ibba la igil Budtrus jara. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Xagho Hirudos atxazayotu kallasa wa kim iirakbayu, minna qeghbat taxaghghagha wa ib qaadamotom ammara.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 12:19">Mot Hirudos</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Wa xare Hirudos min Yahudiya asik Ghaysariiya gesa wa maddat kalá diiba. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Wa gor sab Sur wa Sayda ghidtdtub qala. Ka igil lisaalumu wafid laákaw ajil munatom minna baladu qalat. Wa la wafid masnado min Balaatos la imunna malik kasba salaam igil lidtlab ilom minnu.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Itta amqilla qidim, Hirudos bilaayya milku labsa wa it qarshu tgassa wa la shaqab kaadtaba. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Wa la shaqab waghghala wa bela, “Illa kirin rabbi indeíko, kirin aadami iiko.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Wa jallaab xamde igil Rabbi yahaba, agiidaay maláak Molaay shawadtayu wa tawqin balqayu wa mota.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Zaqat Rabbi laata matnashaar wa afrayot attalaalet.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Wa waan Barnaaba wa Shaawul muhimmatom xagho atmamaw min Orshaliim qaghbalaw. Yuxanna bardu Marghos la litbahal inde nasáw gorom.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Nadí Shaawul wa Barnaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Wa diibba kaniisat la diib Andtaakya gale nabyaat wa maqalimiin qalaw wa minnom Barnaaba wa Samqaan la Tsalliim litbahal wa Lukkiyus la baqal Al Ghayrawaan wa Manaayiin la min niúshu baak Hirudos la xaakimma ruboq trabba wa Shaawul. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Wa amqil xatte saaymaam inintom wa Molaay inlaqabdo, la Rox Ghiddus belayom, “Barnaaba wa Shaawul karriso iyye jallaabba shighil la iglu adhekowom.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ka xagho semaw wa ddaqaw wa ideyom karaw ittom, nadáwom.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Ghubrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Wa la Rox Ghiddus kilíitom kim laáka, jahat Sulukiya darraw wa minna asik Ghubrus abxaraw. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Wa Salaamiis dolat batsxaw ib zaqat Rabbi bashsharaw diibba maqaabidda Yahud. Wa Yuxanna littaalayom qala kim sedyaayom.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Wa killa la jaziirat kaayadaw asik Baafus batsxaw wa ken shaxartaay Yahudi nabi xassaay Baaryashuq la litbahal rakbaw. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Wa hitu min Sarjiiyus Bulus xaakim Ghubrus magharrab qala wa la xaakim zaki nabra. Ka Barnaaba wa Shaawul tlaaka wa zaqat Rabbi igil lidgamo ilu dtalba minnom. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ka la shaxartaay Qayliim qaaradayom (illa maqnat simetu ta) wa Bulus minna emaan igil liblas xaza. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Darbu Shaawul la Bulis tsamma ibba Rox Ghiddus milú inintu ginnixu it Qayliim atkara <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />wa belayu, “Inta wilud Abliis inta wa abaay killu raateq inta! Wa ib kil ajnaas ghash wa kidaq mulú inta. Bataatan cawi agbuy Molaay la raatqat iitqabadtir. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Aze ide Rabbi didka igil titmaddad wa igil maddat igil tiqur tu wa tsaxaay ma igil tiré iiko.” Wa it qintaatu shush tsilmut tkarra wa la tetiyu igil lirkab hatamaatama.<verse eid="ACT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />La xaakim la jara dolat raá, amna ajil ib taqliim ib Molaay qijjub qala.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Andtaakya Bisiidya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Wa Bulis wa dtarru min Baafus asik Barja diib Bamfiiliya abxaraw. Wa ken Yuxanna Barnaaba wa Bulis tfanta wa asik Orshaliim qaghbala. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Wa hitom min Barja asik Andtaakya la diib mudiriyat Bisiidya saafaraw. Wa la maqbad la Yahudi ataw amqil sabit wa tgassaw. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Wa xagho minna shariiqat wa akitbatta nabyaat gharáw, la merxatta maqbad zaqat laákaw ittom, “Xawna, igilla shaqab liíkat adfaót min bikum, ib maqrufkum bola minkum.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ka Bulis bidtaaru gabá wa ib idehu ashshara wa bela, “Shaqab Israíil wa umammiyiin la Rabbi taqabdo, attansuni. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Rabbi shaqab Israíil abawna xara wa shaánna shaqab rafqa itta la diib Masir kaláwa wa ib xiilat xaaylat minna balad lahay la shaqab afgara. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Wa igil maddat qarbaqa sanat latghaarib diibba dangarat kahalayom. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Wa min ardat Kanqaan saboq shaqab nawaka wa awrasayom ta. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Wa illi killu qarbaq miít wa ximsa sanat lagabbí kalá.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Wa xaghohan Rabbi ghaadyotaat wada ilom asik waghit nabi Samuíl. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Wa xare la shaqab malik dtalba minnu wa Rabbi Shaawul wad Ghiis min ghabilat Binyaamiin shayyama ittom wa qarbaqa sanat xakmayom. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Wa xare Rabbi qandtalayu wa Daawid shayyama ittom wa Rabbi, ‘Daawid wad Yassi inaas libye waafigh rakabkowu,’ bela ittu. Wa, ‘Killu la ilu iradde wadde.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Samwiil 13:14, Mazmur 89:20 wa Ishqiyá 44:28</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Wa asik Israíil Rabbi min talak Daawid Mangifaay baqasa kimma waqadaya. Wa hitu Yasoq tu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Wa ghadam mitsát Yasoq, Yuxanna Al Maqmadaan killu shaqab Israíil asik maqmudiyat tobat tlaaka. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Wa Yuxanna seru inlaátammim bela, ‘Ana min imaslakkum halleko? Ana hitu yaána. Hitu xaghoye igil limtsá tu, ana fetxaay siraak isínu igil ibgá yaástihil.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Xawye min wilaad Ibraahiim wa umammiyiin ferhat Rabbi, zaqatta mangafo asikna tlaákat. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Shaqab Orshaliim wa xikkaamom Yasoq iifarragaw wa misil illi ib xaakamotu zaqotaatta nabyaat la kil sabit titgharrá atmamaw. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Jarimat mot taqabatstsex inde iirakbo ittu min Biladtos igil laqaghtillu dtalbaw. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Wa killu la tkattaba ittu xagho naffazaw ittu, minna saliib karawu wa diib ghabir ghabrawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Wa laakiin Rabbi min mot qaghnatsayu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Wa igil amqilotaat bizxaat igilla min Al Jaliil asik Orshaliim saafaraw mislu abhaza. Wa hitom aze igilla shaqab lishshido ilu.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Wa xina illa xina ibba Rabbi abawna waqada ibbu inbashshirkkum hallena. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Wa igilna wilaadom atmamayu ajil Yasoq min mot qaghnatsa kimma diibba Mazmur la kaaláay tkattaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Inta walye inta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">yom abuka gaáko.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 2:7</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Rabbi min mot qaghnatsayu wa matqashqaash bataatan kim iirakkibbu, tahaaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Illa wuqud la ghiddisit wa imnit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">la Daawid waqadko ibba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">igil habakkum tu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishqiyá 55:3</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Wa diib mazmur biqid Daawid libil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ghidduska igil litqashqash iittaázzim minnu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mazmur 16:10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Daawid it gimmu ghasid Rabbi kadma wa darbu mota wa qaaghaab abawu tsabdta wa min matqashqaash iitarfa. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Minnaata Rabbi la min mot qaghnatsayu, matqashqaash yaqarrayu.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Sababu xawye yahaw, ib Yasoq ib maghfirat zinub titbashsharo. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Wa ib gabeyu la laámmin killu min kil zanib litbarrá. Shariiqat Musa laata kiínna igil tide iitghaddir. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ka daggago la nabyaat belawu igil iilidtdtabbagh itkum:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Intim ghebbat ginxo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">wa taqajjabo wa hilako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ana it maddatkum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">widdaay nafar ma min laássilakkum ibbu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">wiyaámankumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">igil ide tu.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xabaghogh 1:5</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Wa Bulis wa Barnaaba la maqbad inlaxadgo la shaqab la sabit la ghiblaata ibbilli sinaq igil laádrusom dtalbaw minnom. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Wa xagho la ijtimaaq aktama bizxaam minna Yahud wa la mathawidiin la qebdat asar Bulis wa Barnaaba gabáw wa hitom haye diib niqimat Rabbi igil lisbato tfaanawom.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Wa itta sabit la ghiblaata, ib gabbí killa la madiinat jammaqat zaqat Molaay igil lismaqo. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Wa waan la Yahud la maxaabir raáw ib ghiirat malláw wa la Bulis libillu qala qaaradaw wa qayarawu.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Wa darbu Bulis wa Barnaaba ib bataakat balsaw ittom, “Ib zaqat Rabbi igil nibalghakkum ib salif daruri qala wa sabab tgaarafkuma, it nafiskum kim xayot diima iitaástihilo xakamkum. Ka aze jahatta umammiyiin nitwallab hallena <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />jalla Molaay ibbilli wassenna wa bela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Igilla umammiyiin nur wadekoka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">asikka firadda midir</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">mangafo igil laámtsí.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishqiyá 49:6</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ka la umammiyiin illi xiin samqaw farxaw wa zaqat Molaay sharrafaw. Wa killom la Rabbi igil xayot diima qayyanayom amnaw.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Wa zaqat Molaay diib killa la mandtighat tnashsharat. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Laakiin la Yahud la anis la ferhiyaat Rabbi la simuyaat wa la sab la merxatta madiinat fatnaw. Wa did Bulis wa Barnaaba dtaras harrasaw wa min mandtighatom dtardawom. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ka min qaaghaabom qisaas nagfaw kim ishaarat nagot wa asik Iighuniya gesaw. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Wa la darasa ib lawagh wa ib Rox Ghiddus miláam qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Diib Iighuniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Diib Iighuniya Bulis wa Barnaaba kim lamadom maqbadda Yahud ataw wa ib atkarot tahaagaw. Ka jameq waaseq minna Yahud wa la umammiyiin amna. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Minnaata la Yahud la amiin abaw la umammiyiin haarasaw diidda emnat wa ibbi asoraw ittom. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ka Bulis wa Barnaaba ken wakkadaw ib ghiloq ib niqimat Molaay inde bashshiro wa hitu liíkatom ayada ib xiilat hiibatom mistinkiraat wa qajaayib igil laájru.<verse eid="ACT 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Wa shaqabba madiinat tkaffala; galehom baakka Yahud txazzabaw wa galehom baakka luúkaam. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Wa la umammiyiin wa la Yahud missilla merxatom didda luúkaam madrarot qaghdaw igil laátqayurom wa igil lirjomom. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ka kashfaw ibbom wa asik madiinat Listara wa Darba la diib mandtighat Liikaúniya litrakkaba wa la baakaatan harbaw. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Wa diiban bashsharot attalaalaw.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Listara wa Darba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Wa diib madiinat Listara inaas kirsuy wa min mawalladu xankiish wa min niíshu killu killu la iitaakaba nabbir qala. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Wa higya Bulis laáttanse qala ka Bulis fazzayu wa kim litshaffe emaan raá ittu. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ka adhayu, “Kib de, bidtaarka gibá,” belayu. Ka la inaas kartaf wada wa heraar astabda.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ka la maxaabir widiit Bulis xiin raáw ib Liikaúniyat hatfaw, “La aalihat it hayát bashar asikna tkarret!” inliblo. <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Barnaaba Zafsa samawu wa Bulis Harmas jalliib hitu mathaagyaay riknaay qala. (Zafsa wa Harmas aalihat qalaw.) <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Wa kaahin Zafsa, la maqbadu itta mifgaarra madiinat qala, qabqirat wa akaaliil zuhur itta maáteyya madiinat amtstsá ajil hitu wa la maxaabir karaamaat igil lighaddimo ilom xazaw.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Laakiin dolat la luúkaam ibbilli samqaw, libbaasom sharaadtadtaw iikabte igil laárú wa jahatta maxaabir ashshaafagaw inlidtdtaarxo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Yahaw sab, jalla mi illi twaddu hallekum? Xina ma, bashar kimsalekum xina. Bishaarat naámatstsí ikkum igil min illa sinaq maaytat igil taqaghbilo asik Rabbi la xiyaay, Kalghaay midir wa sama wa baxar wa killu la halla diiban. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Itta ghadaamiit killa umam it makayida tarka ila. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Wa misil illi imbal shaahid la asku laxabbirrom iitarkayom; hitu min sinnu zilaam wa ittey it iinaatom razghekkum. Hitu nabarriit razghekkum wa albaabkum lawagh malá.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Wa xagho illi ma, min karramot iglom ib ghaliil igil likriqiwom iighadraw.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Wa xare gale Yahud min Andtaakya wa Iighuniya matsaẃ wa la maxaabir askom dallaw. Wa Bulis rajmaw wa asik kadan saxabawu jalla mota maslayom. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Wa xagho la darasa tkallalawu, ghantsa wa asikka madiinat qaghbala. Wa amqil xaariit hitu wa Barnaaba asik Darba saafaraw.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Wa sabá bashsharaw wa bizxaam emnat kasbaw. Wa xaghohu asik Listara wa Iighuniya wa Andtaakya la diib Bisiidya qaghbalaw. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wa la darasa sando wa laádaffó qalaw la emaan igil laxadtidto wa, “Mamlakat Rabbi igil niíte ib bizox igil nixilaf bina,” belawom. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Wa Bulis wa Barnaaba igil ayi kaniisatka sab gats qayyanaw wa ib daqa wa som Molaay la ittu tankabaw ammanawom.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qighbalat asik Andtaakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Wa xagho ib Bisiidya xalfaw Bamfiiliya batsxaw. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Wa diib Barja ib zaqat Rabbi basharaw wa xare asik Attaaliya saafaraw. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Wa min Attaaliya asik Andtaakya abxaraw la diiba ghadam illa, igil niqimat Rabbi tkarrasaw ajilla waghey la aze asfawu.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ken kim batsxaw la kaniisat gats xid jamqaw wa ib killu la Rabbi ib gabeyom wadayu ballaghaw wa kafo kim baab emaan kasta igilla umammiyiin. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Wa ken gorra darasa bizox kaláw.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mishkilat diib Andtaakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wa gale sab min Al Yahudiya jahat Andtaakya darraw wa la xaw laádarso qalaw wa liblo, “Igil tingafo iitghadraw min iititkashabo xassabba lamaden la Musa adrasayu.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Illi Bulis wa Barnaaba makxadda lilliqit attawda baakom. Ka Bulis wa Barnaaba misil gale emnat biqidaam killufaam qalaw jahat Orshaliim igil laqaghlolu wa la luúkaam wa sabba gats igil litwaajho ib kisus illa ghadiyat. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />La kaniisat saarxattom wa ib Finiighiya wa Saamira insaafro ib hidaayat umammiyiin ballaghaw. Illi kabar illi killom la xaw afraxa.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Dolat Orshaliim batsxaw la kaniisat wa la luúkaam wa sabba gats raxabaw ibbom wa hitom ibba Rabbi ib gabeyom wadayu killu ballaghawom.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majlis Orshaliim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Wa xare galela emnat la tabaq la firghatta Farriisiyiin qalaw ghantsaw wa belaw, “La umammiyiin igil litkashbo halla ilom wa shariiqat Musa igil lidtqo laátxaziyom.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />La luúkaam wa sabba gats illa masálat igil laáddaawro ajtamqaw. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Xagho bizox nighaash, Budtrus ghantsa wa kaadtabayom wa belayom, “Xaw yahaw, intim taámro min maddat Rabbi la umammiyiin min afuye liíkatta injiil igil lismaqo wa igil liímano araada. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Rabbi la lib kashshif, kim ghablayom azhara ajil Rox Ghiddus wahabayom kimma intilena. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Wa fingena wa fingehom iifanaata jalliib ib emaan albaabom adthara. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Intim, jalla mi Rabbi igil taáttamtixinu jarbo ib kari magzam itta asigdatta darasa, magzam xina nigbá aw abawna dtawiiru iikahalna? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Lá! Xina kim ib niqimat Molaay Yasoq nagafna naámmin kimma intilehom.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Wa la jameq killu azma Barnaaba wa Bulis inde laáttanse ibba mistinkiraat wa la qajaayib la Rabbi ib gabeyom fingela umammiyiin ajraya. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Waan kallasaw, Yaqghub tahaaga wa bela, “Yahaw xaw, attansuni. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Samqaan Rabbi ib salif kim matxassaaru ibba umammiyiin ará ib tabanni gale minnom igil nosu sharxa. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Zaqatta nabyaat illi twaafigh kimma diibba Kitaab kitub halla:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Xagho illi igil qaghbil tu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">kemat Daawid la taxanfasat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">igil indagh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">ib xadiis min girgiroha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">igil ashninna,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />taariffa addaam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">killom la umammiyiin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">la simechche raffaqo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">iyye igil laánaadu,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">libil Molaay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qaamus 9:11-12 </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">wedyaay illa wadaddiit<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />la min ghadam immir qalat.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Kim fikrachche itta umammiyiin la asik Rabbi laqaghablo igil naákbid iiwajjib. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Bidaalu igil niktab wa igil naássiílom la nabra la asnaam najjasatta wa zina wa siga bihiimat xinghat wa dam igil lisarroqo <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />ajil Musa min badiir wa asik illa atbaaq hallaw ilu it kil madiinat wa shariiqatu laqallimo wa diibba maqaabid kil sabit gharriíwa hallaw.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gharaarra majlis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Wa xare la luúkaam wa sabba gats misil killa la kaniisat gale minna sabóm xaraw wa asik Andtaakya laákawom baak Bulis wa Barnaaba. Yahuza la Barsaaba litkaane wa Siila xaraw la fingela xaw merxat qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Wa gorom la illi tale jawaab nadáw:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Min xawkum, la luúkaam wa sabba gats, asikka xaw la umammiyiin diib Andtaakya wa manaadtigh Surya wa Kiliikiya. Salaam!<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Gale min ina fagraw imbal ajjazotna wa gallabawkum wa afkaarkum zargaw ibba la ilu liblo samqana. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ka gale sab igil nixire wa asikkum igil nilaákkom attafaghna baak galaggilna Barnaaba wa Bulis, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />illa hitom la ib xayaatom kaadtaraw ajil simet Molaay Yasoq Al Masex. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Sababu Yahuza wa Siila inliík hallena ib af la katabnaahu igil liballighukum. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Igil Rox Ghiddus wa igilna sanni treéna millaqal ila dtalabaat igil iinaqadturakkum. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Min nabra igil asnaam kirrimit wa min dam wa min siga bihiimat xinghit wa min zina riimo. Min illa sinaq min tshankako laxaaysakum.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:29">It salaamat.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ka refqatta liíkat tbaggasaw wa asik Andtaakya darraw wa la emnat jamqaw wa la liíkat sallamawom. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Wa la addaam gharáwa wa farxaw sabab liíkat adfaót gabát. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Wa Yahuza wa Siila la nafsom naybaat qalaw igilla xaw laátxaadtaro wa laásbito bizox belaw.<verse eid="ACT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Wa xagho baakka xaw maddat kaláw saarxawom ib madxar salaam asikka laákawom. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Laakiin Siila tariif ken atxayasa.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diibba bazxa sijilaat ghadimat aayat 34 yiínrakibba</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Laakiin Bulis wa Barnaaba diib Andtaakya tsanxaw wa diiba hitom wa biqidaam bizxaam adrasaw wa ib zaqat Molaay bashsharaw.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulis wa Barnaaba litfanaataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Xagho maddat Bulis igil Barnaaba belayu, “Araxka, naqaghbil la xaw igil nigaanex wa xaalatom igil nidle diib killa la madayin la ib zaqat Molaay bashsharnaaha wa kafo kim hallaw niré.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaaba Yuxanna la bardu Marghos litbahal igil linsoó baakom xaza. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Minnaata Bulis illa fikrat illa kim gillit nasáya jalla Yuxanna diib Bamfiiliya hajrayom wa la shighil yaátmama gorom. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Wa fingehom finger laqa ka kilé gabey kedaw. Barnaaba Marghos nasá wa asik Ghubrus abxara. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Laakiin Bulis Siila xara wa la xaw asik niqimat Molaay saarxawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ib Surya wa Kiliikiya xalfa la kanaayis inlaade.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Tiimusaawus Bulis wa Siila littaale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bulis Darba batsxa wa xare Listara la darasaay la Tiimusaawus litbahal qala diiba. Wa immu Yahudiyat emnayit qalat laakiin abuhu Yunaani qala. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Wa la xaw diib Listara wa Iighuniya ib sin faalu lithaagaw qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Ka Bulis igil mislu laásaafiru xaza wa akshabayu ibba sababba Yahud la diibba balad lahay saaknaam qalaw jallaab killom abuhu kim Yunaani tu laámro qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Wa min madiinat asik madiinat insaafro gharaaraatta luúkaam wa sabba gats la diib Orshaliim ballaghaw la shaqab igil lidtyaqa. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ka la kanaayis diib emaan faddabat wa amqilka qilba wassik qala.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xalif asik Maghiduniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulis wa mattaalyatu ighliim Firiijiya wa Ghalaadtya shaagagaw xagho Rox Ghiddus qallamotta zaqat diib mudiriyat Aasiya kaláyom. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Wa xidud Miisiya waan batsxaw, Biisiinya igil litaw jarrabaw minnaata Rox Yasoq iisamxa igilom. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ka ib Miisiya xalfaw wa asik Taruwaas darraw.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Wa itta laali laha Bulis rúya raá. Diiba inaas min Maghiduniya baadtir wa litrajjayu raá, “Naqa asik Maghiduniya wa sidena,” inlibil. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Xagho Bulis la rúya raá kim Rabbi diib Maghiduniya igil nibashshir tlakenna fahamna, wa ittaana igil giyaas daalena.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulis wa Siila diib Fiilibbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Min Taruwaas ibbaana asik Saamsaraaki abxarna wa fajrata safarna asik Niyaabuliis attalalena. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Wa minna asik Fiilibbi la mustaqmarat Romaaniyat wa la madiinat la salfayit diib mandtighat Maghiduniya safarna. Wa diiba qamqelaat kalána.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />It sabit minna mangaátta madiinat gats kadan gisna asikka nahar wa ken akaan daqa igil nirkab saéna. Wa tgassena wa la anis la ken jimqaat qalaya igil nithaage astabdena. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Wa minna laáttansiya qalaya issiit Liidya titbahal taajrat dtaagaat arjuwaani min madiinat Siyaasiira wa qabdayit Rabbi qalat. Molaay libba fatxa liíkat Bulis igil tighbal. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Waan hita wa dtewaha taqammadaw asik beta qazmattanna wa belat, “Emnayit ib Molaay min taxasbuni, niqino wa it bechche tkarraw.” Wa atámanattana.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afgarot rox najis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Maddat xatte asikka akaan la itta liddaqaw iningayis amat rox qiraafat la qala ila wa ibbu ib mastaghbal titnabbá qalat tghaabalattanna. Wa igilla manaabiita ib qiraafat girush bizxit taákassib qalat. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Illa hita daribna gabát wa intitdtaarax wa intibil, “Illom sab kedmat Rabbi la Wighghul tom. La gabey la ibba tnagfo laxabbirukum hallaw.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Illi igil bizox amqilotaat atwaalettu. It dangoba sabab Bulis marra daayagha twallaba wa igilla rox, “Ib simet Yasoq Al Masex igil tifgar minna ammirakka halleko!” belayu. Ka agiidaay la rox xadgaya.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulis wa Siila diib sijin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Waan manaabiitta amat qiin kasabom naadtfat raáwa, Bulis wa Siila tsabdtaw wa asikka sug jarrawom igil litxaakamo. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ghadamma xikkaam amtsáwom wa belaw, “Illi sab Yahud tom wa diibba madiinat ghinuts laághantso hallaw <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />ib adrasot qaadaat igilna la Rumaaniyiin igil nighballa aw nimaarissa la iilitájjaz.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ka la maxaabir tfarrara ittom wa la xikkaam lababbisom atghandtadtaw wa azzaabadtawom. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Xagho sanni atkarbajawom, diib sijin twaggaraw wa la sajjaan igil ib sidud laqighabbom taámmara. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />La sajjaan illi amir illi kim tkabbata diibba sijin karis semayom wa it asghaagh taqziib qaghaabom ghaayada.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Taghaarib migib laali, Bulis wa Siila liddaqaw wa ib zikir Rabbi laxamdo qalaw wa la sijunaam laátansiwom qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Wa ammat alaba zilzaal dighghub talaw wada wa arkaanna sijin hanzaza wa baabaatu ib gidiida agiidaay tkaasatat wa salaasil killom la sijana traahet.<verse eid="ACT 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Wa la sajjaan xasosa wa baabaatta sijin kustit dolat raáya sayfu amshasha wa nafsu igil lightal xinkato tarfattu ajil la sijunaam harbaw maslayu. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Laakiin Bulis dtarxa ittu, “Nafiska iitimadrir! Kilna insar hallena,” inlibil. <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Xaghohu la sajjaan anwaar dtalba wa asik karis hagta ib fijaq inlaqarqade wa ghadam Bulis wa Siila harbadta. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Wa xare mingof kadan afgarayom wa saálayom, “Manaabiit, mi igil ide biye igil ingaf?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ka balsaw ittu, “Ib Molaay Yasoq iman wa inta wa dtewaaka igil tingafo tu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Wa xare ib zaqat Molaay tahaagaw igilu wa igil killom dtewaahu. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Wa itta saaqatta laali laha la sajjaan nasáyom wa ajirraxatom xatsba illom. Wa agiidaay hitu wa killu la dtewaahu taqammadaw. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />La sajjaan asik betu amtsaáyom wa nabra ghaddama illom. Wa farxat xaadratu qalat jalliib hitu wa killu dtewaahu ib Rabbi amnaw.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Waanna fakaak la xikkaam qaskarom laákaw asikka sajjaan ib amir dtalughom. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ka la sajjaan Bulis assaála, “La xikkaam ib dtalughkum ammaraw. Ka figaro wa silal salaam kaaydo!” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Minnaata Bulis igilla qaskar belayom, “Ghadam addaam jaldawna imbal maxaakamat mawaadtniin Rumaaniyiin inxina wa diib sijin wagrawna. Wa aze ib situr igil litbarraó min ina laxazzu hallaw. Abajá! Hitom nosom limtsó wa laáfgiruna.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />La qaskar ibbilli la xikkaam ballaghaw wa dolat Bulis wa Siila kim mawaadtniin Rumaaniyiin tom samqaw tahajjamaw. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ka igil lidakkulom matsáw wa minna sijin afgarawom minna madiinat igil lifgaro inlitrajjawom. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Wa xagho Bulis wa Siila minna sijin fagraw asik bet Liidya gesaw wa diiba la xaw rakbaw wa atxaadtarawom. Wa xare taxayyabaw.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Diib Tasaaluniiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Wa xare Bulis wa Siila ib Amfiibuliisa wa Abuluniya saafaraw wa Tasaaluniiki batsxaw. Wa diiba maqbad Yahudi qala. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Wa Bulis kimma lamadu la maqbad ata wa igil salas sabit minna Kitaab naaghashayom. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Wa sharxa wa bayyana ilom la Masex kim igil limtsats wa min mot igil lighnats kim qala ilu. Wa belayom, “La Yasoq la ibbu ibashshirakkum halleko la Masex tu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wa galela Yahud aghtanqaw wa misil Bulis wa Siila taxaabaraw kimma bizxaam minna Yunaaniyiin la ferhat Rabbi wa anis sharifaat bizxaat.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Wa Yahud biqidaam ghanáw ka gale sab shawsharat jamqaw min matraakabihom wa fawdat asoraw diibba madiinat. Wa bet Yaasun hajmaw Bulis wa Siila inlaxazzu asikka maxaabir igil laámtsiíwom. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Laakiin kim saánawom Yaasun wa galela xaw la biqidaam jarraw ghadamma xekmatta madiinat. Wa dtarxaw wa belaw, “Illi sab la iddinya killa gallabaw aze insar matsáw <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />wa Yaasun diib betu attarxaba ibbom. Hitom marsumma Ghaysar naghdo hallaw wa, ‘Malik biqid Yasoq litbahal halla,’ liblo hallaw.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Waan la jameq wa xekmatta madiinat illi samqaw jodtat harrasaw. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Wa xare Yaasun wa la biqidaam damaanat adfaqaw wa qarxawom.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Biiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Kim masa inintu la emnat Bulis wa Siila asik Biiriya nadáw. Wa ken dolat batsxaw maqbadda Yahud ataw. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wa Yahud Biiriya min Yahud Tasaaluniiki litsharrafo qalaw wa la liíkat ib miraad wa lawagh tkabbataw wa minna ritqiinaaha Kitaab kil amqil litxaggago qalaw la Bulis libillu qala amaan min tu igil litákkado. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wa kim figgariit Yahud bizxaam amnaw wa bizxaat anis Yunaaniyaat shariifaat amnaya wa bizxaam sab Yunaaniyiin.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Laakiin waan Yahud Tasaaluniiki Bulis diib Biiriya ib zaqat Rabbi bashshir halla aamaraw, galehom ken gesaw wa la maxaabir fatnaw. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />La emnat agiidaay Bulis asikka nageb nadáw laakiin Siila wa Tiimusaawus diib Biiriya tarfaw. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wa la Bulis afgaraw asik Asiina amtsáwu. Wa xare ib amir qaghabalaw igil Siila wa Tiimusaawus ib shafaag igil litxaaboru.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Asiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Bulis diib Asiina inlitsabbarrom ib raáyat la madiinat ib asnaam milít, marra ghimum qala. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ka diiba maqbad misilla Yahud wa la Yunaaniyiin la ferhat Rabbi naaghasha. Wa diibba sug amqilka la xaadraam lithaage qala. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Jamaaqat minna falaasifat Al Abighuriyiin wa Ruwaaghiyiin wa igil litfaarodu astabdaw. Galehom saálaw, “Illi hilluf mi igil libal laxazze halla?” Wa galehom, “Aalihat gaana nashshir halla,” belaw. La sabab la illi belaw ibbu jalliib Bulis ib Yasoq wa ghaniitsu min mot bashshir qala tu.<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Wa darbu asikka ijtimaaqla Aryubaaghus amtsáwu wa saálawu, “Illi adrasot xadiis la ilu taádarris halleka, igil naámirru litghaddar? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />La iitsanxat afkaar insammeq minka hallena ka maqnata igil nifham naxaze hallena.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Killom seknat Asiina wa la gaana la diiba saaknaam waghtom it naaghashot illa afkaar la xaddaas ledta laxaalufu qalaw.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higya diib Aryubaaghus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Xare Bulis it ijtimaaq Aryubaaghus bidtaaru gabá wa bela, “Yahaw sab Asiina, diib kil gaátkum marra maddayiniin titraáwni hallekum <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />sabab jawalko wa sinaqla qibaadatkum ib atkarot taayankowa wa akaan, ‘Igil qibaadat yiímmur ilaah’, kitub itta ma reéko. Ka la ilu taqabdo hallekum yiímmur tu, wa ana ibbu igil ibashshirakkum tu.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />La Rabbi la iddinya wa killu la halla diiba mana, hitu Molaay midir wa sama tu wa hitu diib hayakil ib idey shighiit iisakkin. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Wa it kidmat aadami ghaddimma xiguz iiko jallaab hitu tu la igil aadami xayot wa tinfaas wa kil gaá lahayib. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Wa min orot inaas killa la umam azra killu la midir igil tixdar. Wa la awghaat wa la akaanaat la quriit la diiba sakno xaddada. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Rabbi illi addaam igil lixizayu wa igil lishaaógu wa qasa alla rakkubu wadayu min ayiinaaka rayiim ma min iigabbí. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ajil diibu innabbir wa nitxarrak wa hallayotna minnu tu. Kimma galela shaqaraakum belawa, ‘Xina talaku xina.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ka xagho talak Rabbi gabána la Ilaahla kon kim surat min dahab aw fiddat aw imin saayigh simmuma igil ninsú alabna. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Itta ghadaamiit Rabbi tamaasil illa ghiwet hammala laakiin itta xaadrat killu la addaam itta hallaya la halle igil litobe laámmir. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Sabab la amqil la iddinya ib qadaalat laxaakim itta ibba inaas la ilu qayyana xaddada wa igil killu min kim tu asbata ib min mot qaghnasotu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ghaniits min mot kim samqaw inintu galehom tarjaga. Laakiin biqidaam belawu, “Ib xadiis ibbilli mawdoq igil tithaage naxazzeka hallena.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Kiínna Bulis minna majlis fagra. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Galehom Bulis talaw wa amnaw. Wa Diyuniisyus min illom qala wa nafar majlis Aryubaaghus qala wa bardu issiit Daamaariis titbahal wa biqidaam ma qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Matraakaab Bulis wa Akiila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Bulis xagho illi Asiina girraahu haba wa asik Kurinsus gesa. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Wa diiba Yahudi Akiila la litbahal, diib Bundtus ittub rakba. Wa hitu misil issiitu Biriiskiila min Idtaalya min matsá ghirub waadi qala ajil Koludiyus ib digna killom la Yahud min Roma immur qala. Bulis igil ligaanxom gesa <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />wa jalliib sheghyaay kiyam kimsalehom qala xadra wa gorom shagha. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Sabitka diibba maqbad ajil attaghnaqotta Yahud la Yunaaniyiin naaghish qala.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Wa waan Siila wa Tiimusaawus min Maghiduniya matsáw, Bulis igil bashsharot ledta tfarragha igilla Yahud Yasoq la Masex kim tu inlishhid. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Laakiin la Yahud dol qaardawu wa ajáraw ittu, bilaayu kafkafa kim ishaarat nagot wa belayom, “Damkum raáskum baatsex tu! Ana masúlechche abtsaxako. Xagho illi asikka umammiyiin igil igiis tu.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Xaghohu Bulis la maqbad xadga, asik Dtiidtus Yusdtus la qebdaay Rabbi la betu la maqbad guwirit gesa. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Wa Kiriisbus la riíssa maqbad wa killu dtewaahu ib Molaay amnaw wa bizxaam min sab Kurinsus la liíkat samqaw amnaw wa taqammadaw.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rúya Bulis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Laali xatte Molaay diib rúya Bulis tahaaga wa belayu, “Iitifrah! Mathaagaay iitátghaaric! Iitíizam <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />jallaab ana misilka halleko, oro igil lihjam itka wa igil limadriraka iiko sabab diib illa madiinat addaam bizxaam hallaw iyye.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Jalliibu Bulis zaqat Rabbi inde laádarrissom sanat wa sar kalá.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ghaaliyun xaakim Akaaíya waan qala la Yahud gats xid it Bulis hajmaw wa asik maxkamat amtsáwu. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Wa attajramawu wa belaw, “Illi inaas la shaqab laátámin halla Rabbi igil liqibadaw ib gabey la misilla shariiqat titqaarad.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bulis ghirub mathaagaay inintu, Ghaaliyun igilla Yahud belayom, “La shakwatkum ib qagab aw ib jariimat biyyin min taqale igil attansekum watwajjaba ichche. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Minnaata ajil misil saálaat zaqotaat wa asmaay wa shariiqatkum titsaabadt, noskum xilola. Ana illa tmassil ghadiyat yiífarrid.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Wa asaru minna maxkamat dtardayom. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Wa xare killom it Sustaaniis riíssa maqbad wadghaw wa ghadamma maxkamat zaabadtawu. Ghaaliyun laata killu raásu iitxassara ibbu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qaghbalot Bulis asik Andtaakya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bulis diib Kurinsus gale waghit kalá. Wa xaghohu la xaw xadga wa asik Surya abxara wa Biriiskiila wa Akiila taalawu. Ghadamu cigaru atlaadta diib Kankiriya, jallaab nazir naazir qala. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Afasus batsxaw wa diiba Bulis Biriiskiila wa Akiila xadga. Hitu di la maqbad ata wa la Yahud naaghasha. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ziyaadat waghit igil litsnax baakom dolat dtalbaw minnu iighabla. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Laakiin inlissaarax minnom qidim wada wa bela, “Ib af Rabbi igil qaghbil tu.” Darbu min Afasus abxara. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Wa it Ghaysariiya tkarra wa kaniisat Orshaliim igil lizzaayar qaghlola wa xare asik Andtaakya darra. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Xagho gale maddat kalá diiba ssaarxa minna wa min akaan asik akaan saafara diib mandtighat Ghalaadtya wa Firiijiya killom la darasa inlaátxaadtidt.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abollus diib Afasus wa Akaaíya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Itta maddat laha Yahudi Abollus la litbahal diib Al Askandariya ittub asik Afasus matsá. Hitu inaas qillum wa la Kitaab amrat shaamlat la laámmir qala. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Gabey Molaay lighghun qala wa ib xamaas tirud kadtba wa ib Yasoq ib raateq adrasa, maqmudiyat Yuxanna ledta ma laámir min laqale. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Diibba maqbad qaddaxa tsaqda igil lithaage astabda. Waan Biriiskiila wa Akiila samqawu diib betom qazmawu wa gabey Rabbi ib baarih sharxaw ilu.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Dol Abollus asik Akaaíya igil ligiis xaza, la emnat atxaadtarawu wa itta darasa diib Akaaíya katbaw igil laárxibo ibbu. Waan batsxa igilla la ib fadil niqimat Rabbi amnaw sadayit libula yaqala, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />jalliib la Yahud ib xiilat ib riúy simoq diib makxadda aazama wa minna Kitaab Yasoq la Masex kim tu asbata.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bulis diib Afasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Waan Abollus diib Kurinsus qala, Bulis ibba manaadtigh la laqaaliit xalfa wa Afasus batsxa. Wa diiba gale darasa rakba. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Wa saálayom, “Rox Ghiddus tkabbatkum dolat amankum?” Ka balsaw, “Iifaalna, nosu ib hallayot Rox Ghiddus iisamqana.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ka Bulis saálayom, “Ka mi maqmudiyat tkabbatkum?” Ka balsaw, “Maqmudiyat Yuxanna.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Ka Bulis bela, “Maqmudiyat Yuxanna maqmudiyat tobat qalat. Hitu la addaam la ibba darbu matstsí igil liímano ballaghayom. Wa hitu Yasoq tu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Kim illi samqaw ib simet Molaay Yasoq taqammadaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Dolat Bulis ideyu kara ittom, Rox Ghiddus tkarra ittom wa ib hagaggit biqidat tahaagaw wa tnabbaáw. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Qasir kilót inaas lagabbó qalaw.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Wa la maqbad ata wa ib qaddaxa tsaqda tahaaga igil salas warex wa inlitkaxaddom ib mattaghnoqo ib mamlakat Rabbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Laakiin galehom qaanadaw wa amiin abaw wa ib riúy Gabey Molaay qatghaalalaw. Ka Bulis xadgayom wa la darasa nasá goru diibba ghaaqatta ijtimaaq la naay Tiiraannus amqilka nighaash laátgaayis qala. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Wa illi igil kilé sanat attalaala. Sababu killom la Yahud wa la Yunaaniyiin la diib mandtighat Aasiya saaknaam zaqat Molaay samqaw.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Rabbi ib gabey Bulis muqjizaat saadtdtaat laájarre qala <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />ka la ma manaadiil wa la maqanaadigh la tamtamattu asikka xamayim tnassaát wa ghabaahom ssaara wa la arwaax la sharriirat xadgattom.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wa gale minna Yahud la majjawlat la arwaax la sharriirat liddaagano qalaw simet Molaay Yasoq igil laqastaghillo jarbo qalaw wa liblo, “Ib simet Yasoq la Bulis bashshir ibbu figar!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Wa la illi waddu qalaw saboq wal kaahin Yahudi qiggul, Saakwa la litbahal qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Amqil xatte la rox la sharriir balsa ittom, “Yasoq ammirru wa Bulis yiíghawiyu laakiin intim, min xina tibaw?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Wa xare la inaas la rox la shirriir maalku sarra ittom wa killom ghalba wa falal libulu iifallayom. Ka minna bet biraaghaatom abardagaw wa admaayom intijjaanan.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Wa la Yahud wa la Yunaaniyiin la diib Afasus saaknaam ibbilli aamaraw wa killom farhat tkarret ittom wa simet Molaay Yasoq tsharrafat. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Ka bizxaam minna amnaw matsáw wa ib ghiloq ibba wadaddiit la makrahat qatarafaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wa bizxaam minna sabba shixir akitbatom jamqaw wa ib qalan andadawa. Wa qawla waan xasbaw, ximsa alif xabbat fiddat fagra. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Wa kiínna zaqat Molaay tnasharat wa tgawet.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Wa xagho illi killu jara, Bulis asik Orshaliim igil ligiis gharrara wa ib Maghiduniya wa Akaaíya igil lixilaf. Wa bela, “Xagho diiba xadiirye bardu Roma igil igaanex halla iyye.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kilót minna sedyatu asik Maghiduniya laáka wa hitom Tiimusaawus wa Arasdtus. Hitu laata diib mandtighat Aasiya galetaay kalá.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judtat diib Afasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Itta waghit lahey diib Afasus judtat kelmayit ghantsat ib kisus Gabey Molaay. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Hita ib sabab saayigh fiddat Dimitriyus la litbahal astabdet. Hitu tamaasiil fiddat sayyigh qala igil haykal ilaahat Ardtaamiis wa hitu wa la saayaghiin sanni rabboxo minna qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ka gats xid adhayom wa bardu la mashshaaghyatu wa belayom, “Yahaw intim, xina min illi shighil kim inkassib iitghawu. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Wa intim tirú wa ssammoqo hallekum illi nafar Bulis kafo bizxaam kim atámana wa ajla insar diib Afasus wa bas inde iigabbí diib mabzex mandtighat Aasiya wa libil, ‘Aadami la shaaghiha aalihat, killu killu aalihat iiko.’ <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Illi aafat igil tijaaratna ledta iiko, bardu haykal iilaahat Ardtaamiis la qaalyat saham alabu wa la iilaahat nafsa la diib mandtighat Aasiya killa wa la iddiniya titqabbad haybata taxaggil.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Illi dolat samqaw ghaharaw wa dtirxaat ambataw wa belaw, “Ardtaamiis la naay Afasus wighghil ta.” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Wa agiidaay la madiinat killa dtirxaat qammaya. Wa la addaam it Ghaayus wa Aristarkus dtar Bulis la min Maghiduniya hajmaw wa asikka saaxat saxabawom. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulis itta maxaabir igil laábhiz xaza laakiin la darasa manqawu. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Galela masúliinna mandtighat la amallihiit Bulis ma liíkat laákaw ittu inlitrajjawu itta saaxat igil iilitárad.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />La jameq ribuk qala, galehuka ib shankatu laánaadih qala. La bazxaw addaam la ma hadaf la igilu ken qalaw yaámaraw. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />La Yahud la migibba maxaabir qalaw Iskandar gats ghadam darrakawu wa igilla maxaabir la amir igil lishrax dtalbaw minnu. Wa hitu igil liízamo ashshara ilom ghadamma shaqab igil lidaafeq. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Laakiin waan kim Yahudi tu fahamaw gats xid twaaqaw igil kilé saaqat la gabbí wa belaw, “Ardtaamiis la baqal Afasus wighghil ta!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Wa kaatibba madiinat la maxaabir atázama wa bela, “Sab Afasus yahaw, killa la iddinya madiinat Afasus qeghbayit haykal Ardtaamiis la wighghil wa timsaala la min sama tkarra kim ta taámmir. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Sabab illa amaan illa orot iilitbarraya, hawido wa ib haliit xatte iitidaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Intim illi sab amtsákum la haykal iilisragho wa iilaahatna iilisbabo ma indiiko. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ka Dimitriyus wa mashaaghitu did ayi nafar shakwat min bom la maxkaakim wa la ghaadyotaat ghadamehom hallaw. Shakahom igil laátlu ghadraw. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Wa biqid ma min bikum it mashwarat ghaanuniyat igil litxakkam bu. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Itta aze ta kilna sababba yom jara jaza fancagaar waganxenna wa xina xijjat waíirakabna ajil illi tsiraar mabaggasi alabu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Xagho illi bela la mamaxbirat fartaka.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Diib Maghiduniya wa Yunaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />La ciic dolat antahat Bulis itta darasa laáka wa xagho atxaadtarayom, “Daxan xadagko itkum,” belayom wa asik Maghiduniya tbaggasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Wa diibba mandtighat jawala ib atxaadtarot inlithaage igilla addaam wa it dangoba Yunaan batsxa. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Diiba salas warex kalá. Wa ghirub abxarot asik Surya inintu la Yahud diddu muámarat laxabko kim hallaw batsxayu ka ib Maghiduniya igil laqaghbil gharrara. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Gale sab saafro baaku qalaw wa hitom Subaaturas wad Birros la min Biirya wa Aristarkus wa Sakundos la min Tasaaluniiki wa Ghaayus la min Darba wa Tiimusaawus wa bardu Tikikus wa Tirufiimos la min mandtighat Aasiya tom. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Hitom ghadamena gesaw wa diib Taruwaas tsabbarawna. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Wa xagho Qiid Fadtiir xalfa, min Fiilibbi abxarna wa xagho xamis amqil la biqidaam qarrena diib Taruwaas wa diiba saboq amqil kalána.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulis Aftiikus min mot laqaghannits</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Itta amqilla saamin la salfayit wajbat igil nitxaawal jammaqana wa Bulis la addaam tahaaga wa ajil la amqil la asara safar naawi qala asik migib laali mathaagaay attalaala. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Diibba odat la laqaaliit la diiba ijtimqaam qalna anwaar bizxit taxaya qalat. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Wa it shibbaak, mandalaay Aftiikus la litbahal giisyu qala. Bulis higyaahu inlaáttalaale hitu hirgaate qannatu, wa kim ghasna min saalsaay dur wadgha wa maayit inintu traffaqa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ka Bulis tkarra wa aghama ittu wa jareydu dtabdtaba ittu. Wa bela, “Simínna ikkum, xiyaay halla.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Wa xare ib xadiis laqal qarga wa raghiif falma wa balqa wa darbu higyaahu attalaala asik fakaak wa xare saafara.<verse eid="ACT 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />La sab la mandalaay ib xiyaayu asik betu nasáwu wa sanni taqazzaw.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulis sab gats Afasus Ghaabiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Xina ghaddamna wa asik Asus abxarna minna Bulis igil nitsqan. Hitu illa sittaat jallaab asik ken ib aggaar gayis qala sattaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Waan diib Asus twaajhenna tsaqanaahu wa asik Miitiiliini abxarna. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Fajrata min ken abxarna wa miqiddaay Kiyus batsxana. Wa la amqil laásara jafar Saamus wa itta asara Miiliitos batsxana. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bulis asik min ken Afasus igil laábxir sittut qala min xaalafot waghit diib mandtighat Aasiya igil lishshankak sabab Orshaliim igil libtsax shaafig qala min litghaddaru ghaddemaay Amqil Ximsa.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Wa Miiliitos dolat batsxa asik sab gats kaniisat Afasus liíkat laáka wa diiba igil limtsó wa igil lighaabolu dtalba minnom. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Waan batsxaw kiínna belayom, “Intim kafo tnaabarko gokum taámro minna amqil la diib mandtighat Aasiya igir kareko, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />wa ib tawaadoq iilissatar wa qinbeq ghizir Molaay kadamko wa la jirab la muámaraatta Yahud karetta ichche kahalko. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Bataatan min ballaghot wa waqaz ibba laáfaydakum ib qalan wa diib abyaatkum xar yiíbe. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />La Yahud wa la Yunaaniyiin tfaaneko it Rabbi igil litobu wa ib Molaayna Yasoq igil liímano kim bom.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Wa ana aze asik Orshaliim igayis halleko ib darke Rox Ghiddus wa diiba mi kim kiruy iyye halla yiídalle. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ledta ana laámmirru la Rox Ghiddus diib madiinatka kim laxazziranni sijin wa la kirab kim igil twaajhuni tu. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Minnaata igil xayochche ghiimat yahayibba ghadam batsex hadafye wa atmamotta muhimat la Molaay Yasoq kallafenni ibba, igil ib injiil niqimat Rabbi igil ishhad.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Ana aamir halleko intim la diib migibkum la ib mamlakat Rabbi waqazko, oro minkum xagho illa igil lirénni iiko. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Yom qallin halleko kim amiin qalko. Jalliibu ayi minkum mot diima min mayit ghalacce iiko <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />jallaab min atámarotkum ibba Rabbi igil ghasdayu killu gats xar yiíbe. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Nafiskum wa la salif la Rox Ghiddus attawqalekkum tu qighabo imbal naafraay. Talach kaniisat Rabbi la ib damu zaabaya gibó. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Aamir halleko xagho gisko karach girgirit diib migibkum igil tigbá tu wa la salif igil timxak iiko. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Min fingekum ma, la amaan la tawu igil lighnatso tu asarom la darasa igil laájlu. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ka iitighfalo wa fighado igil salas sanat xazzarot kil minkum amqil wa laali qinbiqye injannin yaátkaaramko.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Illi kiínna inintu, itta azeta igil Rabbi wa zaqat niqmatu isalmakkum halleko igil tisnadakkum wa meraas igil tahabakkum migib killom la igil nosu qaarayom. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ana fiddat nafar aw dahabu aw libbaasu iiraghabko. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Intim noskum taámro ibbilli ideyye maxaagijje wa maxaagiz telyachche kim qaratteq qalko. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Diib killu la wadekowu ibbilli shighil tsalliim la xawaanyaam kim igil nisde bina arekokum ib faghudatta zaqat la Molaay Yasoq nosu belaya, ‘Barkat hiyaab min nissá tbazzex.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Xagho illi bela, misil killom abraka wa ddaqa. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Inlaxaghghufu killom jaamamaw wa saqamawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Wa millaqal killu la atxazanayom bahalatu xagho illa gatstsu kim igil liráw iiko tu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 20:38">Xaariit asikka safiinat saarxawu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Asik Orshaliim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Xagho tbarbarna minnom jahat Kus ib rittoq abxarna. Wa la amqil la xaariit Rudos batsxana wa minna asik Baatra twajjahna. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Wa ken safiinat asik kataay Finiighiya inde tbattik rakabna ka tsaqanna itta wa abxarna. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ghubrus kim treéttanna digalab xadagnaaha wa asik Surya ghaddamna asik Sur batsxana wa itta karena ajil la safiinat diiba daraba igil tikre qala ila. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />La darasa xagho rakabna, ken baakom saboq amqil kalána. Ib gabey Rox Ghiddus Bulis tfaanaw asik Orshaliim igil iilaqaghlole. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Laakiin waghitna kim akla safarna igil naáttalaale tbaggasna. Wa la darasa killom misil ansom wa ajanniitom asikka mifgaarra madiinat saarxawna wa itta nageb ib rikoq daqena. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Xagho twaadqana itta safiinat qaragna wa hitom asik qaddom qaghbalaw.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Butulamaayis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Wa safarna attalaalena min Sur asik Butulamaayis wa diiba la xaw saalamna wa amqil xaalafna baakom. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Wa la amqil la asara ininsaafir Ghaysariiya batsxana. Wa diiba Filibbos la mabashshir la orotta Sabqat tgashshena. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Wa hitu qarbaq walat awaaldo qalaya ilu wa hitan litnabbaá qalaya.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Wa xagho ken amqilotaat xaalafna, nabi Aghaabus min Al Yahudiya darra. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Kim matséna mandtagat Bulis nasá wa nafsu asra ibba wa idayu wa qaghaabu aasir inintu bela, “La Rox Ghiddus libil, ‘Baqal illa mandtagat, Yahud Orshaliim kiínna igil liísoru tu wa la umammiyiin igil lisallumu tu.’”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Waan illi samqana xina wa la addaam la ken qalaw Bulis dakkalna asik Orshaliim igil iilaqaghlole. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Asaru Bulis balsa, “Igil mi tbakku wa libye tagharraxo hallekum? Ana duluy halleko diib Orshaliim, igil itaássar ledta inde iigabbí, igil imut diiba ma jalliib simet Yasoq.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Wa kim qaghnaqot aba inna azamna minnu wa imbe, “Iraadat Molaay titmam.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Wa xaghohu daalena wa asik Orshaliim twaghghalna. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Gale minna darasa la min Ghaysariiya taalawna wa asik bet Manaasun amtsaáwna mislu igil nitsnax. Wa hitu darasaay ghadiim min Ghubrus qala.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diib Orshaliim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Waan Orshaliim batsxana la xaw ib lawagh kabbatawna. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Tsibbixiita xina wa Bulis Yaqghub igil nigaanex gisna wa sabba gats killom xaadraam qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Wa Bulis saalamayom wa ib tafsiil ibba Rabbi wadayu fingela umammiyiin ib gabey kidmatu dagma. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Dolat illi samqaw Rabbi xammadaw.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:20">Wa xare igil Bulis belawu, “Xuna, kam aalaaf minna Yahud kim amnaw tiré halleka wa killom igilla shariiqat mutaxammisiin tom. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Hitom inta killom la Yahud la fingela umammiyiin saaknaam igil min Musa littawnako kim taqallim wa ajanniitom igil iilaákshibo aw kimma lamadna igil iilitnaabaro kim taámmir samqaw. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ka mi nibasir? Simmaqom ib mitsátka iitarrif. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ka la niblakkaatu wide. Qarbaqat inaas bigona wa hitom nazir nazraw. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ka nisóm wa dtahaaratom taxaawal wa figgarom difaq igil litgalxaw. Wa kim figgariitu, killu la tbahala itka miney kim tu igil lifhamo, wa inta noska minna shariiqat fitik kim iitibil. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />La emnat la umammiyiin lakassis, gharaarna katabna ilom min nabra igil asnaam ghiddimit wa min dam wa min siga shinghit wa min zina igil lijjamalo kim bom.<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Wa itta amqil la asara Bulis la sab nasá wa mislom dtahara. Wa xare la haykal ata makallasila qilatta tadthiir igil lisajjil wa la sadaghat igil ayihomka igil titghaddam.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isro Bulis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />La saboq amqil ghirub xaliif kim gaáya gale Yahud min mandtighat Aasiya Bulis raáw diibba haykal. Ka killu la maxbar fatnaw wa tsabdtawu <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />inlidtaarxo, “Wo Israíiliyiin, sidawna! Illi tu la killu wa it kil akaan did shaqabna wa shariiqatna wa illi haykal laádarris. Wa bardu diibba haykal umammiyiin aata wa la akaan la ghiddisit najjasa.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Ghadam illa Tirufiimos la baqal Afasos baak Bulis riíyaam qalaw diibba madiinat wa diibba haykal aatayu amsalaw.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ka killa la madiinat hejat wa killu la addaam min kil ghileq ib saqey matsá. Wa Bulis tsabdtaw wa minna haykal saxabawu wa bigiidaay la manaagí daabát. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Wa igil lightolu inde jarribo, madiinat Orshaliim ib tamaama shawsharat kim qammatta ghaayidda desh la Romaani batsxa. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ka itta dolu gale merxat wa qaskarom nasá wa gats taxat daggaxaw asikka maxaabir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:32">Wa la rabbaashyaam waan raáwom, zaabaadt Bulis atkaaramaw. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Wa la ghaayid shaága wa tsabdtayu wa ib kilé silsilat igil litaássar ammara. Wa darbu min kim tu wa mi kim wada la maxaabir saála. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wa la maxaabir galehomka ib fintuy anaadha. Ka jalla la ghaayid ibba sababba shawsharat la amaan igil libtsax iighadra, Bulis asikka xaamyat igil litnassaá ammara. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Wa dolat Bulis la qatabaat batsxa la shaghabba lammat sanni zaayada ka la jinud igil lirfiqiwu tghassabaw. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Wa la maxaabir la darbu gaát tsiraara attalaalet, “Litqaadam!” intibil.<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daafqot Bulis ghadam Yahud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />La jinud asikka xaamyat igil laáatuwu ghaarbaam inintom, Bulis la ghaayid saála, “Xatte igil issaálakka?” Wa la ghaayid, “Yunaaniyat tithaage iiseékoka!” inlibil balsa ittu. <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Inta la Masri la ghadam illa sawrat harraska wa qarbaq alif irhaabi asikka baadobat marxaka yiínta?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Ka Bulis balsa, “Ana Yahudi min Dtarsus la diib Kiliikiya ana, mawaadtin madiinat ghallaal yiána. Ib maqrufka la shaqab ithaage xidaganni,” inlibil.<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40-1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40-1" />Ajjazotta ghaayid xagho rakba Bulis itta qatabat badtra wa asikka shaqab ashshara. Wa killom dolat azmaw, ib Araamiyat belayom, “Wilaad qad yahaw, aze daafqochche attansu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:40-1" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ka dolat ib higyaahom lithaagayom samqawu, xim batkaw.<para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Wa xare Bulis bela, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ana Yahudi diib Dtarsus la diib Kiliikiya titrakkab wilud ana. Laakiin diib illa madiinat trabbeko wa shariiqat abawna ib gabaya taqallamko min af Ghamaalaaíil. Wa igil Rabbi, baqal qillat qalko kimma intim yom hallekuma. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Wa telyat illa Gabey qadtrasko asik mot batsxaw, sabóm wa ansom inaasir wa diib sijin inísayimmom. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Bardu la riíssa kahana wa killu la majlis ibbilli lishshid. Jawaabaat ma attafgarko minnom asikka xawom la diib Dimashgh qalaw inde atásarkowom asik Orshaliim igil attamtsóm igil litqaaghabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />It addihir gayis Dimashgh shiíg inána, ammat alaba nur daamigh min sama diwaarye talal bela. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ka midir batsxako wa kirin samqako, ‘Shaawul, Shaawul, igil mi taátkalaabtanni halleka?’ intiblanni. <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Ka saálko, ‘Min inta mamba?’ Ka balsa, ‘Ana Yasoq la Naasiri la inta taátkalaabtanni halleka ana.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />La dtarye la nur raáw laakiin la kirin la tahaagettanni iifahamawa.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ka saálko, ‘Molaay, mi igil ide halla iyye?’ Ka la Molaay xabbarenni, ‘Kib de wa asik Dimashgh giis wa diiba la litwajjab itka igil litxabbarakka tu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Wa dtarye ib tiitey asik Dimashgh aatawni jalliib la damaaghatta nur raáy kaláttanni.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Inaas Xanaanya litbal diib Dimashgh nabra wa hitu taghi wa diibba shariiqat raasik qala. Wa Yahud Dimashgh killom laáxtarumu qalaw. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ka matsá wa madtorye badtra wa belenni, ‘Shaawul xuye, bocka tkabbat!’ Wa ittaaye reékowu.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Wa xare belenni, ‘Rabbi abawna iraadatu igil taámir wa La Saalex igil tiré wa minnu igil tismaq xarekka. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Shaahudu igil tigbá tu igil killu ibba reékaahu wa samqakaahu. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Mi titstsabbar halleka? Bidtaarka gibá, taqammad wa zinubka titxatsab ikka ib sami simet Molaay.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Wa xaghohu asik Orshaliim qaghbalko wa diibba haykal iniddeqe jazabat tsabdtattanni. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Wa diib rúya Yasoq belenni, ‘Shifag Orshaliim tirak ajil sabá shahaadatka ajilye laábbu!’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Ka belko, ‘Molaay, hitom ana kim diib kil maqbad la ibbika la amnaw isaajin wa izaabidt kim qalko laámro. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Wa dolat dam shahiidka Istifaanus kaqa xaadir qalko wa it ghatlu waafaghko wa balalliit ghetlatu qaghabko.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Wa asaru Molaay, ‘Rayiim! Igil indaáka tu asikka umammiyiin,’ belenni.”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para><para style="s">Bulis mawaadtin Rumaani</para><para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Wa la maxbar Bulis attansa asik illa bela. Wa asaru dtaarxaw, “La midir qaghlil minnu! Hitu xayot iitaástihillu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Inde lidtaarxo wa balalliitom inde waagro wa gats laqal cabal inde kaashxo, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />la ghaayid ib aatayot Bulis diibba xaamyat ammara wa amir ib jaldu asdara minna sababba dtiraarra shaqab igil litxaghagh. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />La jinud igil jalid inde laátradtqiwu, Bulis igilla merxaayya miít la ken baadtir qala, “La ghaanun ib jalid mawaadtin Rumaani inde iilitxaakam sammex ikkum?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />La merxaayya miít illi xiin samqa, asikka ghaayid gesa wa ibba jara akbarayu wa saálayu, “Mi igil tibassir tu? Illi inaas mawaadtin Rumaani tu!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ka la ghaayid asik Bulis gesa wa saálayu, “Assílanni, inta mawaadtin Rumaani inta?” Wa Bulis, “Afo,” balsa ittu. <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Darbu la ghaayid, “Igil mawaadtanachche qawil ghaali dafqako,” bela. Ka Bulis balsa, “Ana laata mawaadtin ib mawallad ana.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wa la igil litxaghghagho minnu ghaarbaam qalaw agiid ansaxabaw. Wa la ghaayid fajjaqa jallaab ib asru ammara mawaadtin Rumaani inintu.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Tsibbixiita la ghaayid sababba ittihaamma Yahud igil Bulis igil laámir xaza. Ka dtallaghayu wa ruásaala kahana wa killu la Majlis igil lijjammaqo ammara. Wa xare Bulis amtsá wa ghadamehom qabdtarayu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 22" /><chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" /><para style="s">Ghadamma majlissa Yahud</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bulis shimuy la Majlis fadtna wa bela, “Xawye yahaw, asik yom ib damiir xiyaay nabarko ghadam Rabbi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ka Xanaanya riíssa kahana la jafar Bulis baadtraam qalaw ammara it afhu igil lidtfiquwu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Xare Bulis belayu, “Rabbi igil lidtfaqka tu, inta ghabir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ib Yunaaniyat “xedtat”</char></note> tsaqada mirrug. Inta mi ghaadi inta? Inta la noska la ghaanun tkayid ib dtafqiye ib ammarotka.” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wa la jafar Bulis baadtraam qalaw belawu, “Mi tu la kaahin Rabbi la qaali atqayireka?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ka Bulis balsa ittom, “Xawye itássaf, la riíssa kahana kim tu iifahamko, jalliib la Kitaab libil, “Did ayi min xikkaamka ib shar igil tithaage alabka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matqaddaay 22:28</char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Wa Bulis galella Majlis Saddughiyiin kim qalaw wa galehu Farriisiyiin aamara. Ka bela ib wighul, “Xawye, ana Farrisi wad Farrisi ana. Ib sabab saáyob diib baqas min mot itxaakam halleko.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Waan illi bela, finge la Farriisiyiin wa la Saddughiyiin kilaaf laqa wa la xaadraam tkaafalaw. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(La Saddughiyiin xagho mot baqas yahalla wa malaíkat wa arwaax yahallet liblo qalaw laakiin la Farriisiyiin ibbilli killu laámno qalaw.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ka judtat saamqat tkokasat wa gale minna qilamala shariiqat la Farriisiyiin qalaw ghantsaw wa ib sidud tkaxadaw wa belaw, “Ittilli inaas ghaladt iirakabna. Kafo tu rox aw maláak huguyu min laqale?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Wa la kilaaf marra taxashkaba. Sababu la ghaayid Bulis igil iilissaadtar sagá. Ka la desh ammara igil liddarre wa ib xilat igil linsú minnom wa asikka xaamyat igil laámtsúwu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Wa la laali la asara, Molaay ghirub Bulis badtra wa belayu, “Simínna ikka. Kimma diib Orshaliim, bardu diib Roma igil tishhad iyye bika.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para><para style="s">Muámarat ghatil Bulis</para><para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Wa fajrata la Yahud muámarat qaghdaw wa it nafsom billaq wa siito xarramaw asik Bulis iighatlaw. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Min qarbaqa inaas wa laqal diibba muámarat shaarakaw. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Asikka ruásaala kahana wa sabba gats gesaw wa belawom, “It nafisna billaq wa sittaay xarramna asik Bulis iighatalna. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Ka intim wa la Majlis minna ghaayid Bulis ghadamkum igil laxaadir dtilabo ib mismisa maqlumat biqidat ghadiyatu igil taqacru. Wa xina duluyaam hallena insar inde iibatstsex igil nightallu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Laakiin wad xit Bulis xiin ibbilla muámarat samqa asikka xaamyat gesa wa assaálayu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Wa asaru Bulis orot minna merxaayya miít atlaaka wa belayu, “Illi mandalaay asikka ghaayid abtsuxu, kabar bu igilu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ka asikka ghaayid amtsáyu wa ghaayidda miít bela, “Bulis la sijun laáka ichche wa illi mandalaay igil amtsaáka dtalba minye sabab la liblakka tu bu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />La ghaayid la mandalaay ib idhu nasá wa shannaka ibbu wa saálayu, “Mi tu la ibbu taákabranni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ka belayu, “La Yahud twaafaghaw fangox amtsoót Bulis ghadamma Majlis igil lidtlabo minka ib mismisa xaazi maqlumat biqidat ghadiyatu igil limemu. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ka iitighbal minnom sabab millaqal qarbaqa minnom diib kamiin litstsabboro hallaw. It nafsom billaq wa sittaay xarramaw asik iighatlawu. Duluyaam hallaw, minka mawafaghat diib dtalabom litstsabbaro hallaw.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Wa la ghaayid la mandalaay xazzara, “La ilu xabbarkanni, orot iitátámir ibbu,” inlibil. Wa xarteni agesayu.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para><para style="s">Bulis asikka xaakim litnassá</para><para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Wa xare kilót minna ghiwaadda miítu tlaaka wa ammarayom, “Kilót miít jindi wa sabqa min firsaan wa kilé miít min sab kawanni addaalu asik Ghaysariiya igil ligiiso yom laali saaqat seq. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Wa igil Bulis matsaqan addaalu ib salaamatu Filiiksa la xaakim igil libtsax,” inlibil.<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Wa xare asikka xaakim illi la talle jawaab katba:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para><para style="pi"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Salaam. Min Koludiyus Liisyaas asik Filiiksa la xaakim xaayis.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para><para style="pi"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Illi inaas, la Yahud tsabdtawu wa igil lightolu ghaarbaam qalaw laakiin ib jinujje matsáko wa attakrekowu ajil kim mawaadtin Rumaani tu batsxenni. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Wa ajil mi kim tahamawu igil aamir xazeko ka asikka Majlisom amtsákowu. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ka la tihimat kim ib ghadiyaat ib shariiqatom titqallagh kim ta batsxako wa jariimat sijin aw mot taábatsex kim alabu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Wa xaariit jamaaqat minna Yahud muámarat diddu qaaghdaam kim qalaw tbayyana iyye ka agiid asikka nadákowu. Bardu la mattihimat ghadiyatom ghadamka igil likrawa ammarkowom.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ka la laali laha la jinud kimma taámmarawa Bulis asik Antibaatriis abtsaxaw. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Wa tsibbixiita asikka xaamyat qaghbalaw wa la firsaan asik Ghaysariiya nasáwu. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Waan Ghaysariiya batsxaw Bulis wa la jawaab Filiiksa la xaakim sallamaw. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Wa xagho gharáyu Bulis saála min aya mudiriyat kim tu. Wa Bulis, “Min Kiliikiya,” balsa ittu. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Ka belayu, “La ghadiyatka dolat mattihimatka matsaó igil iráya tu.” Wa Bulis diib ghasir Hirudos igil litqaghghab ammara.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 23" /><chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" /><para style="s">Balaagh Yahud did Bulis</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Xagho xamis amqil Xanaanya la riíssa kahana wa mislu gale sab gats wa maxaami Tartulos la litbahal asik Ghaysariiya darraw igilla xaakim balaagh igil lighaddimo did Bulis. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Wa la xaakim waan Bulis tlaaka, Tartulos tihimat wajjaha ittu ghadamma xaakim wa bela, “Ib fadilka igil waghit sanni ib salaam tnaqamna wa rúyatka igil ummatna islaaxaat amtsaát. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Xaayis Xaakim Filiiksa, xina ibbilli naqtarif it kil akaan wa min kil ghileq wa ib xamde ghaazrat. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Igil atxacir ikka xinkato igil tismaqanna itkattalaka.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Illa hitu maswiraay sú wa fancagaar migibba Yahud diib killa la iddinya kim tu kashafna. Wa riíssa mazhab la Naasiri tu. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />It raás illi, la haykal igil laáfsid jarraba ka tsabadtnaahu. [Wa ibba shariiqatna igil naxaakimu xazena. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Laakiin Liisyaas la ghaayid matsá wa ib xiilat min ideyna farghaghayu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Wa mattihimatu ghadameka igil lixdaro ammara.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Illa aayat diibba bazxa sijillaat yahallet. </char></note> Noska dolat taátamtixinnu la amaan ib kisus illa daqaawi la xina diddu inraffaqa hallena igil tibrah ikka tu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />La Yahud itta tihimat saadaw wa la daqaawi amaan kim ta akkadaw.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para><para style="s">Difaaq Bulis</para><para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Waan la xaakim igil lithaage ashshara ilu, Bulis balsa, “Ana ammir igil sanotaat ghaadi illa ummat kim halleka. Sababu ib lawagh idaafeq. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ana min asik Orshaliim matsáko igil qibad min qasir kilé amqil walaqil kim iiwadeko iibadde minka. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Mattihimachche diibba haykal oro initkaxad iirakbawni aw diibba maqaabid aw diibba madiinat shawsharat inharris. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Illi sab la ibbu littahamoni hallaw igil laásbutu ichche iighadraw. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ligbá ma indiíko, Rabbi abawna kim qabbid ilím xasabba Gabey la hitom firghat sammiwa. Ib killu la shariiqat waafigh wa diibba akitbatta nabyaat kitub ammin. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Wa it Rabbi nafsu la saáyob la illi sab lisíyu biye wa hitu la saalxaam wa la iisaalxaam kim libqis. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Jallaab illi diima damiir saafi igil lahalle iyye misil Rabbi wa misil addaam itqadtdtam.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Xagho sanetaat asik Orshaliim qaghbalko ib maqunaat igilla gidqaam minna shaqabye wa gharaabiin igil ighaddim. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Wa la mattihimachche maraasiimma dtahaarat inatammim raáwni. Wa ken maxbar yaqala wa fancagaar. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Wa gale Yahud min mandtighat Aasiya ken qalaw ka igil limtsó qala ilom tihimat min bom ichche igil lighadduma. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Aw illom la xaadraam hallaw ghaddamma Majlis waan badtarko, la jariimat la illa rakbaw ichche lismaw <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />imballa la xatte maddat la inde waghalko, ‘Yom ib sabab emaanye ib baqas taxaakmuni hallekum,’ ibe.”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Wa xare Filiiksa la minna Gabey yighghun qala la jalsat rafqa wa bela, “Xikamye it ghadiyatkum dol Liisyaas la ghaayid matstsí igil asdirru tu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Merxaayya miít ammara, Bulis igil liqighab wa gale xiriyat igil lixidag illu wa igilla amallihiitu igil lizuru wa igil likdomu igil lismax ilom.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Wa xagho amqelaat Filiiksa wa issiitu Dorusila wa hita Yahudiyat qalat matsáw. Wa Bulis atlaaka wa attansayu ib emaan ib Yasoq al Masex inlithaage. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Waan Bulis ib salaax wa ib tsabiidt nafis wa la xikim la matstsí tahaaga, Filiiksa farha wa bela, “Aze giis, xaariit waghit dolat irakkib igil atlaakekka tu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Wa bardu Bulis igil lirshayu lisé qala ka dolka lilík ittu wa lithaagayu qala.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Wa xagho kilé sanat xalfya, Filiiksa Burkuyus Fastus kalfayu. Laakiin sabab Filiiksa igilla Yahud fadil igil lide xaza Bulis diib sijin xadga.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 24" /><chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" /><para style="s">Ghadam Fastus la xaakim</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Xagho salas amqil min mitsát Fastus asikka mudiriyat, Ghaysariiya xadga wa asik Orshaliim qaghlola. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Wa ken la ruásaala kahana wa merxatta Yahud daqaawihom did Bulis ghaddamaw ilu <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />inlitxassobu Bulis igil laáttamtsí asik Orshaliim kim fadil ajlom jallaab itta gabey kamiin widtdtuyaam ilu qalaw igil lightolu. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fastus laata balsa ittom, “Bulis diib Ghaysariiya tsibudt halla wa ana noshshe it bagaayid igil igiissa tu.” <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Wa belayom, “Sab gatskum misilye liddaraw ikkum wa didda inaas daqaawi min bom lirfiqiwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Wa xagho samaan aw qasir miqil xaalafa baakom, asik Ghaysariiya darra wa itta amqil la asara magassey xikim tsabdta wa ib attamtsaót Bulis ammara. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Bulis waan matsá la merxat la Yahud la min Orshaliim tkallalawu wa ib tiham bizxit wa kadtiirat tahamawu wa igil laásbuta iighadraw.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Wa Bulis la daqaawi tbarra, “Ana didda shariiqat la Yahudiyat aw didda haykal aw didda xikumat la Romaaniyat yaájramko,” inlibil. <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Wa xare Fastus la Yahud igil laáfte saálayu, “Asik Orshaliim igil taqaghole raadi inta it xidurye igil titxaakam?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Minnaata Bulis balsa, “Abajá! Illa maxkamatta Rumaan la rasmiyat ta, sababu insar igil itxaakam halla iyye. Inta sanni wa amaan taámmir ana la Yahud kim yaázeko. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Mot la laáttastihil min iwadde, mot yaábbe. Min tissarar, oro xagh alabu it ide illi sab igil likrenni. Sababu asikka Ghaysar astaánif!<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fastus xagho itta amir misil mekratu shora balsa, “Sanni sana. Inta asikka Ghaysar astaánafka wa asikka Ghaysar igil tigiis tu!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Wa xagho amqelaat, Malik Aghriibaas wa Barniiki asik Ghaysariiya matsáw Fastus igil lizzaayaraw. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Wa ken amqilotaat ib widyatom Fastus ghadiyat Bulis zakra igilla malik wa bela, “Insar inaas Filiiksa sijun inintu la xadgayu halla. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Wa diib Orshaliim inana, la ruásaala kahana wa sabba gatstsa Yahud diddu daqaawi rafqaw wa igil adiinnu dtalbaw minye. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ka balasko ittom ghaanunna Rumaaniyiin nafar iilaxaakim la mattihimatu inde iilitwaajah wa bakit difaaq it nafsu inde iilithayabbu. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ka dolat mattihimatu insar matsáw la ghadiyat yaájjalkowa wa itta amqil la asara jalsat wadeko wa ib attamtsaót Bulis ammarko. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Laakiin la mattihimatu waan waajhawu la tihamom diddu minna jaraayim la ila tsabbarko iigaát. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bidaalu misil jadal diib diinom wa misil inaas maayit Yasoq la litbahal la Bulis kim xiyaay halla laásarrir. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Wa mabaggasi la ibbu xabre irakkib kim saánko, saálkowu asik Orshaliim igil ligiis wa diiba igil litxaakam miraad min bu. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Laakiin Bulis ghadiyatu la Imbiraadtor igil laátadtfaxa trajja. Ka igil litqaghghab ammarko asik asikka Ghaysar inaddú litghaddaranni.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Xaghohu Aghriibaas igil Fastus belayu, “La inaas noshshe igil ismuqu xazze halleko.” Ka balsa ittu, “Fangox sammuqu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Wa itta amqil la asara, Aghriibaas wa Barniiki matsáw wa ib ixtifaal faawish tkabbatawom wa ghaaqatta simmaq ataw misilla merxatta desh la ritabom qaalyat wa wijaha la madiinat. Wa Fastus ib attamtsaót Bulis ammara. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Wa bela, “Malik Aghriibaas wa kilkum la xaadraam hallekum, illi inaas tiríwu hallekum la shaqabba Yahud killu diib Orshaliim wa insar diib Ghaysariiya shakayu ichche wa, “Igil limbar alabu,” inde liblo anaadhaw. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Wa ana widiit mot taáttabtsex iirakabko ittu. Laakiin asikka Imbiraadtor ajil astaánafa, asik Roma igil ilákku gharrarko. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Laakiin igilla Jalaalatta Malik amir mimuy ib kisusu la ikatibbu alabye. Sababu ghadam kilkum xaadarkowu ib fintuy ghadameka Malik Aghriibaas kim figgariit illi taxarri la ikattibbu lahalle iyye. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Sabab sijun tihimatu inde iititxaddad igil litlaák min qaghil iimaslanni.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 25" /><chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" /><para style="s">Matghaaraam Bulis ghadam Aghriibaas</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Ka xare Aghriibaas igil Bulis, “It nafiska igil tidaafeq ijaazat bika,” belayu. Ka Bulis ib idehu inlaxabbir matghaaraamu astabda wa bela:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Malik Aghriibaas yaha, it nafishshe daafqochche it xidurka didda tihamma Yahud killa baqal gad waddenni <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />wa la sabab inta qaaraaffa Yahud wa la jidaalom killu sanni taámmirrom. Jalliibu ib asbarot igil taáttasenni itrajjeka.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />La Yahud killom ana min niíshshe kim kafo itnaabar qalko laámaro min istibda xayochche diib balajje wa bardu diib Orshaliim. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Min waghit sanni laámruni ka min litnayato igil lishhado ghadro telyaay mazhabba diinna la matqassib kim qalko bahalat Farriisi nabarko. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Wa la sabab la yom itxaakam ibbu halleko saáyobye diibba waqad la Rabbi abawna waqada ibbu tu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Illi waqad illi tu la ghabayil shaqabna la qasir kilé tamiimu laánokya laali wa amqil ib maqadtam Rabbi inkadma. Aabretka malik, ib sabab illi saáyob tu la Yahud laáttahimuni hallaw. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Amiin qaghnasót Rabbi igilla maaytaam kafo taággam itkum?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Ana ma qightinoq qalko la litghaddaranni killu igil ide simet Yasoq la Naasiri igil qaarid. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Wa illi la diib Orshaliim wadekowu tu. Ib mawaafaghat ruásaala kahana bizxaam minna ghiddiisiin sajanko wa igil litqaadamo sawatko. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Wa kam wa kam diibba maqaabid tnaakasko igil atqaaghibbom wa it manghamo kifur igil ighaasibbom jarrabko. Wa min bizxe ibbiye asik madayin biqidat gisko igil qadtrissom.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Wa igir xatte asik Dimashgh twajjahko ib takliif wa tarkiis minna ruásaala kahana. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Baqal xishmat yaha, it gabey inana taghaarib addihir nur barhatu tsaxaay iitaqarre ba ichche wa it dtarye inlaábarrih reéko. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Wa kilna arid batsxana wa kirin ib Araamiyat titlaakenni samqako intibil, ‘Shaawul, Shaawul, igil mi taátkalaabtanni halleka? Xariibka did iraadachche fariidt balghat tu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ib Yunanaaniyat “fariidt kiraq madrirrakka” </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ka saálko, ‘Min inta mamba?’ Ka balsa, ‘Ana Yasoq la inta taátkalaabitu halleka ana,’ inlibil. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />‘Bidtaarka gibá! La sabab la iglu treékoka kedmaay wa shaahid igil qayinakka tu, ibba reékaahu wa xagho illa la tiriíyu igil tishhad iyye. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Wa minna shaqabka wa minna umammiyiin igil inajjeka tu. Askom ilíikaka halleko <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />qintaatom igil tifaadtigh wa min tsilmat asik barhat wa min saydtarat shedtaan asik Rabbi igil tiblassom maghfarat zinub igil lirkabo wa misilla ib amiin ibbiye tghaddasaw nasiib igil lahalle ilom.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Malik Aghriibaas, xagho laha la rúya la min sama yaqaseko. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ib salif igilla la diib Dimashgh hallaw wa asaru igil sab Orshaliim wa Yahudiya killa wa xare la umammiyiin bashsharko igil litobu wa asik Rabbi igil laqaghbilo wa tobatom ib qamal igil libarhino. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ajil illi tu la Yahud diibba haykal tsabdtawni wa igil lightaluni jarrabaw. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Laakiin Rabbi asik illa maddat gona sadenni ka insar baadtir halleko xawaan wa baagheq inibashshir la wa ibillu Musa wa la nabyaat la tnabbáw ibbu iisarrir <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />wa hitu la Masex kim matstsits wa min mot ghadam killu kim ghannits wa kiínna nur Rabbi laqallin igilla Yahud wa la umammiyiin gats xid.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ka faját Fastus dtarxa, “Bulis, inta naagi yiínta! Bizxe diraasat qayanekka.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ka Bulis balsa, “Shirruf Fastus, ana iinagot alabye. Ana la amaan kibbit ribbit ininta afaggirra halleko. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Illa imur illa igilla malik gaashshayit iiko wa ana ib ghiloq ithaagayu halleko. Ikud ana xatte minna kim iitbadde minnu ajil diib midwaar iigabát. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Malik Aghriibaas, inta la nabyaat taámmin? Kim taámminnom ghaawi yaána.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Wa xare Aghriibaas igil Bulis belayu, “Ittilli waghit xaciir Masixi igil igbá igil taátámnanni tghaddir maslakka halla?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Ka Bulis balsa, “La waghit liriim wa lixicar, Rabbi iddeqe inta wa la sammaqo hallaw killom kimsaleye igil tigbó, illa salaasil la sarraratta.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Wa xaghohu la malik wa la xaakim wa Barniiki wa la xaadraam qalaw ghantsaw. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Wa la ghaaqat xadgaw wa igil xid, “Illi inaas sijin aw mot la laáttastihil iiwada,” inliblo.<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Wa Aghriibaas igil Fastus kiínna bela, “Illi inaas wadtallagha qala ghadiyatu asikka Ghaysar raafeq min iilaqale.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 26" /><chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" /><para style="s">Bulis asik Idtaalya laábxir</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Waan asik Idtaalya igil naábxir tgharrara, Bulis wa gale sijana biqidaam merxaayya miít Yuliiyus la minna katibat la Imbraadtoriyat sallamayom. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Ka safiinat min Adraamiit abxarot asik mawaani Aasiya aammat tsaqanna wa gona Aristarkus la Maghduni la min Tasaaluniiki saafara.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Wa itta amqil la asara it Sayda karena. Wa Yuliiyus Bulis ib sannet tghaarxa wa amallihiitu diib Sayda igil lizzaayar xadgayu maxgazu igil laqartoqo ilu. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Wa min ken asikka baxar tarxena wa asik ghiblat Ghubrus abxarna ajil shamaal takelenna. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ibba kabidda baxar kataay Kiliikiya wa Bamfiiliya mudtuwuraam inxina it Miira la diib mudiriyat Liikiya karena. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Wa diiba merxaayya miít safiinat min Alaskandariya asik Idtaalya wajjihit rakba ka atstsaqanenna itta.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Wa la safiinat ib bishesh insaafar amqilotaat wadet wa xagho shigiit bizxit it dangoba Kiniidus shaágna. Laakiin la shamaal karqenna ka asik inkir Kariit la tsihi taqaddena ib ghirub Raás Salmuni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Wa ib shigiit la kataay initxege abaxarna wa akaan Mawaani Girrim titbahal la ghirub madiinat Lasaaíya batsxana.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Kiínna waghit rayiim abdena wa safar ib baxar bighot gabá itna ajil la iin maghayam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siyaam Kaffaarat</char></note> qalat. Wa Bulis la baxaara nasxa <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />wa belayom, “Yahaw sab, diibba safarna bighot wa kasaar qabayi litraáyaani hallaya, siínna safiinat wa la daraba ledta inde iigabbí, halaak araawexna ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Minnaata merxaayya miít jahatta higyala baxaarra safiinat wa la baqala mayyala bidaal higya Bulis.<verse eid="ACT 27:11" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ajil la miinat igil xaalafot maghayam manaasib yaqalat, la bazxaw baxaara igil lixidogu gharraraw, Fiiniksa igil libtsoxo siíyaam inintom maghayim igil laxaalfo diiba. Wa hita miinat diib Kariit ghiblaat giblat wa ghiblat jahat mudaagh tsaxaay dilulaat ta.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para><para style="s">Qaasifat</para><para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Dolat wilwelaay min shanak giblat walwala la baxaara shanhatom rakbaw maslayom. Ka la marsaat naghlaw wa madtor nageb Kariit abxaraw. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Wa it haninat qaasifat ib ghiblayit mifgaar tsaxaay talle titámmar minna jaziirat taharerabat. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Wa la safiinat la qaasifat laf abalatta wa igil tisdtadtdta iikahalat ka it ideha karena wa attawhalettana. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Wa ibba inkir la tsihi min jaziirat niísh Kuda titbahal abxarna wa xagho jirsat qabbaay ghaaribba najaat la xaaryaay itta maghdtanna safiinat rafqanhu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Xagho itta maghdtan xaadtadtawu, la safiinat min mittaxat ib xibaal ghaaranawa. Ajil matwaxaal diib shamshamat Sirtis farhaw itta la shiraaq adnanaw la safiinat igil titgaffe. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Wa itta amqil la asara la qaasifat xelattana ka la darabba safiinat igil laqanghiso astabdaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Wa itta amqil la saalsayit ib ideyom asaasaatta safiinat wagraw. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Wa tiridda qaasifat amqilka zaayada asik la tsaxaay wa la kawaakib taxajjabaw min ina ka saáyat mangafo la libula batakna.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Wa la masaafriin imbal nabra bizox kaaláam qalaw wa Bulis bidtaaru gaá wa bela, “Yahaw sab, nasixachche igil tismaqo qala ikkum wa diib Kariit min tahawdo waxesekkum wa bighot wa malaadt wasarrayaakum. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Wa itta aze ta taqalaalato ajil oro minkum igil lihilak iiko, la safiinat nagey hadtim igil tigbá tu. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Liliit maláak min Rabbi la ana naayu wa la ilu ikaddim madtorye badtra <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />wa belenni, ‘Bulis yaha, iitifajjeq. Badtiirka ghadamma Ghaysar igil matxaakaam iitarrif wa Rabbi ib niqmatu xayotta sab la goka laábxiro hallaw habekka.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ka yahaw sab xidtaro jallaab ana ib Rabbi ammin wa la belenni tu gabbí. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Safiinatna laata diib jaziirat xatte matwaxaala iitarrif.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Wa it kiflat laali qasir raabqitta qaasifat diib baxar Adriya shamaal inlaqaassanna, la baxaara bar kim shaágaw sammaqayom. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Wa ghurina la baxar ghayasaw ka qisra ghaamat rakbawu wa xagho maddetat qasir xamis ghaamat rakbawu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />La bilagh igil iinirgax faarhaam inintom, minna zinnaabatta safiinat qarbaq marsaat wagraw wa ajil fakaak ddaqaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wa xare la baxaara minna safiinat igil lihirabo jarrabaw wa ghaaribba najaat diibba baxar adnanaw gale maraasi minna kinkishsha safiinat lidhiro inlaáttamsilo. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Laakiin Bulis igilla merxaay wa la jinudu, “Igil titmaayato tu la baxaara diibba safiinat min iitsannaxo,” bela. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ka la jinud xibaalla ghaaribba najaat baatakaw wa litfante xadgawu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Wa ghaddemaay fakaak Bulis killom igil libloqo tfaanayom wa bela, “Sabab marra hillugaam qalkum it nabra inde iitkarru kilé saamin xaalafkum. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Ka azi maqruf daw igil noskum nabra biloq igil titmaxako, kiínna midirrat igil taqarrekum iiko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ib Yunaaniyat: ajil ciggarat min arískum iititnaccab </char></note>” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Wa xare gale raghiif nasá wa ghadam killom Rabbi xammada wa falma wa balqa. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Wa xare killom tshajjaqaw wa billaq astabdaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kilna la diiba safiinat 276 qalna. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Wa xagho tsagbaw, la safiinat igil laqaghlilu la ikil laakafaw diiba baxar.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para><para style="s">Matwaxalla safiinat</para><para style="p"><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Wa kim tsabxa la baxaara la akaan igil lifarrigo iighadraw laakiin kaliij ib simdtatu raáw ka la safiinat asku igil ligfawa gharraraw min litghaddarrom. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ka la maraasi baatakaw wa diibba baxar titragh xadgawa wa la xibaal la sukkaan aasrat faatxaw wa la shiraaq la ghadaamyaay rafaqaw igilla shamaal wa asikka nageb twajjahaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Laakiin la safiinat simdtat rifqit finge kilót tayaar batsxat ka jahatta simdtat shanket ka kinkisha waxala wa kus saána wa la zinnaabata la amwaaj shaalqatta. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wa la jinud la sijana igil lighaatlo sattataw nafar minnom ib ximaase igil iilihirab. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Laakiin merxaayya miít Bulis ib xiyaayu igil laátrif xaza wa minna naffazotta sittaatom awqalayom. Wa la ximaase ghadraw ib salif minna safiinat igil linfaraw wa asikka nageb igil laxammiso ghadamma biqidaam ammara. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Wa la biqidaam ibba alwaaxla safiinat wa ibba tirrafa la biqid ken igil litqaddaw qala ilom. Wa kiínna killom ib salaamatom bar batsxaw.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 27" /><chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" /><para style="s">Diib Maaldta</para><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Kim ib salaamat taqaddena inintu, la jaziirat Maaldta kim tissame taxabbarenna. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wa sabba jaziirat ib raáfat fintiit tkabbatawna. Isaat xaayaw wa xibar raxabaw ibbina ajil zallim wa birud qala. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Wa Bulis isaar qicey ara wa itta isaat inkarriyu arwe xafaanat maalyatu abardaga minnu wa diib idehu nashba. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wa sabba jaziirat la arwe minna idehu landtodtil raáw. Ka igil xid, “Illi inaas ghetlaay igil ligbá bu jalliib minna baxar min tnajja ma Qadaalat mambaro sarraqat ittu,” belaw. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Minnaata Bulis la arwe nafda min idehu itta isaat wa sema darar iijara ilu. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wa la addaam igil lixibadt aw faját igil limut lisíwu qalaw. Wa xagho waghit sanni tsabbaraw wa iilimud jarre ilu iiraáw ka raáyom ghayaraw wa iilaah tu belaw.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Wa ken Bubliiyus la xaakimma jaziirat garhat qalat ilu. Wa diib betu raxaba ibbina, igil salas yom akramenna. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Wa abuhu ib xaz wa figgaar baqal firaash qala. Wa Bulis igil liráyu ata wa xagho ddaqa ideyu kara ittu wa shafayu.<verse eid="ACT 28:8" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Illi waan jara xamayiimma jaziirat la biqidaam matsáw wa tshaffaw. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Wa ibba tfanaata agbuy sharrafawna wa igil nabxir dol daalena la laátxazena asefawna.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para><para style="s">Min Maaldta asik Roma</para><para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Wa xagho salas warex ib safiinat min Alaskandariya la diibba jaziirat ighyimit ghanatsna wa suratta aalihat la Manatiit laadtát itta qalat. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Sariikusa kim batsxana salas amqil xaalafna diiba. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Wa min ken abxarna wa Riighun batsxana wa itta amqil la asara shamaal giblat kabha wa Budtyuli batsxana it kilé amqil. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Wa ken gale xaw rakabna wa saboq amqil igil niklá baakom dtalbaw minína wa kiínna asik Roma sayabna.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wa la xaw ken matsína kim samqaw igil litkabbatuna asik Saaxat Abiiyus fagraw wa diib Kaanaat La Salas. Wa Bulis waan raáyom Rabbi xammada wa sajjaqa. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Wa Roma kim batsxana la daabidt igil Bulis samxa bannu igil linbar misilla jindi la laqaghghibbu.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para><para style="s">Bulis diib Roma</para><para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Xagho salas amqil Bulis la merxatta Yahud gats xid tlaaka wa kim jammaqaw belayom, “Xawye, did shaqabna aw didda qaadaatta abawna xatte ma min yiíwadde diib Orshaliim taássarko wa it ide Rumaaniyiin tkarreko. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ka taxarraw minye wa igil lidtalghuni xazaw jalla qidaam la laáttastihil iiwadeko. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Laakiin la Yahud qaaradaw ka istiínaafye asikka Ghaysar igil irfaq tjabbarko. Illi bahalat did wilaad qajje shaka biye iiko. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ajil illi sabab tu la igil irkabakkum wa ithaagekum dtalabko. Ib sabab saáyat Israíil tu la ib silsilat usur halleko.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ka belawu, “Ib kisuska min balad Yahudiya liíkat iibatsxattanna wa minna xawna luúk ibba laákabranna wa ibbika shakkenna iimatséna. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Laakiin raéyka igil nismaq ajil la addaam it kil akaan illi mazhab kim laqaarid naámmir.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Wa igil litraakabo qidim wadaw wa itta qidmom misil bizxaam asikka akaan la Bulis qala itta matsáw. Min fajir asik mise mamlakat Rabbi sharxa ilom wa atámarayom ibba wa ib Yasoq igil laqaghnaqom jarraba min shariiqat Musa wa minna akitbatta nabyaat. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wa galehom qaghtanqa wa galehom la biqid yaámna. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Wa nos nosom tkaalafaw wa gesaw xagho Bulis illi bela, “La Rox Ghiddus igilla abawkum liíkat amaan laáka ib lissaan Nabi Ishaqayá:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para><para style="q1"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Asikka shaqab giis wa ballom,</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Igil tismaqo tu laakiin iitifhimo</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">wa igil tignaxo tu laakiin iitirú.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para><para style="q1"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Sabab lib illi shaqab shammaqa</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wa izanom kabda</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wa qintaatom qaghammacaw.</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Min tissarrarra ib qintaatom waraáw</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wa ib izanom wasamqaw</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wa ib albaabom wafahamaw</para><para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wa asikye waqaghbalaw wa washafekowom.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaqayá 6:9-10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para><para style="nb"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Sababu igil taámaro xazzekum halleko, mangafo Rabbi asikka umammiyiin kim tlaákat wa kim igil laáttansu tu.” [ <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Xagho illi bela la Yahud gesaw ayxid ib qinif inlitkaxado.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Illa aayat diibba bazxa sijillaat yahallet. </char></note>]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para><para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bulis ken kilé sanat ib gidiidan kalá wa diibba betu la ila tkaara, ibba la igil ginxa matstsíwu laárxib qala. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Ib ghiloq ib mamlakat Rabbi bashshara wa ib Molaay Yasoq Al Masex adrasayom wa mataakil iisaadafattu.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para><chapter eid="ACT 28" /></usx>